(5748133, 836593, 100773, '<td valign="top">Where are the rest of the kids? Are these two bullies that stole their skateboards for this trick? Bleh... It''s a great photo! But maybe it could''ve been a bit darker?</td>', 'Where are the rest of the kids? Are these two bullies that stole their skateboards for this trick? Bleh... It''s a great photo! But maybe it could''ve been a bit darker?', '2009-12-01 09:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
