(5748138, 835523, 51538, '<td valign="top">Image looks like a 3D render rather than a photo.  An interesting treatment, though my initial reaction is "plastic."  I wanted to add that the framing is quite nice too. 6.</td>', 'Image looks like a 3D render rather than a photo.  An interesting treatment, though my initial reaction is "plastic."  I wanted to add that the framing is quite nice too. 6.', '2009-12-01 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748139, 833675, 100773, '<td valign="top">There''s a series of videos on youtube that''s called "you suck at photoshop" (I don''t say that you do!!!!!), and one of them is about treating colors with curves in photoshop. He turns tomatoes into deliciously looking tomatoes. I think that treatment and a bit more sharpening could improve this photo. Anyway, I do feel like eating an apple now. <br/> <br/>And, if you do check out those videos, just be prepared for the lame lame lame humour in it. I learned alot about photoshop from them! 7</td>', 'There''s a series of videos on youtube that''s called "you suck at photoshop" (I don''t say that you do!!!!!), and one of them is about treating colors with curves in photoshop. He turns tomatoes into deliciously looking tomatoes. I think that treatment and a bit more sharpening could improve this photo. Anyway, I do feel like eating an apple now.  And, if you do check out those videos, just be prepared for the lame lame lame humour in it. I learned alot about photoshop from them! 7', '2009-12-01 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748140, 835711, 100773, '<td valign="top">This a very good and very sad photograph</td>', 'This a very good and very sad photograph', '2009-12-01 09:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748143, 835736, 100773, '<td valign="top">I''m very tempted to guess who this is... The lighting looks familiar, but this is not one of your typical shots? I''ll come back to you when the challenge ends!<br/> <br/>Oh, and the photo? Stunning!</td>', 'I''m very tempted to guess who this is... The lighting looks familiar, but this is not one of your typical shots? I''ll come back to you when the challenge ends! Oh, and the photo? Stunning!', '2009-12-01 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
