(5748147, 833277, 104841, '<td valign="top">Full marks for effort and timing, its not often you see them with food. As a photo I am getting distracted with the stuff in the bottom of the frame and it feels unbalanced. I also feel that a touch more postproduction would have helped.</td>', 'Full marks for effort and timing, its not often you see them with food. As a photo I am getting distracted with the stuff in the bottom of the frame and it feels unbalanced. I also feel that a touch more postproduction would have helped.', '2009-12-01 10:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748149, 836132, 100773, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh. It looks like there''s a flash on the camera fired straight at him/her. Getting it to one of the sides helps alot, if that''s not possible you could try and hold a white paper a few inches in front of the flashhead to spread the light a bit more. Photographing pets is very tricky, but you have taken a good photo of your dog anyway.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh. It looks like there''s a flash on the camera fired straight at him/her. Getting it to one of the sides helps alot, if that''s not possible you could try and hold a white paper a few inches in front of the flashhead to spread the light a bit more. Photographing pets is very tricky, but you have taken a good photo of your dog anyway.', '2009-12-01 10:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748150, 831702, 100773, '<td valign="top">HighKey, HighScore! I think is the look you''ll see in many fashionmagazines and blogs these days. Not that I''m an expert.. Good photo!</td>', 'HighKey, HighScore! I think is the look you''ll see in many fashionmagazines and blogs these days. Not that I''m an expert.. Good photo!', '2009-12-01 10:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748151, 836872, 100773, '<td valign="top">Nice toning! I like her look!</td>', 'Nice toning! I like her look!', '2009-12-01 10:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748154, 836594, 110250, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed otherwise would have rated higher</td>', 'a bit overexposed otherwise would have rated higher', '2009-12-01 10:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748157, 836871, 100773, '<td valign="top">My first thought: "WTF?"<br/>My second thoght: "Is this an abstraction?"<br/>My third thought: "Is that a flying bug?"<br/>My fourth thought: "Is this an abstraction of a flying bug?"<br/>My fifth thought: "wtf..."<br/> <br/>I don''t know what to say.. If you have edited it some, then there''s no other way to do it. You''ve taken your photo and done the best you possibly could do with the outcome. Strangest thing, IT LOOKS AWESOME! I''m thinking: maybe black and white? nah... won''t work.. Looks like an old horror movie, sepiatoning then? nah...<br/> <br/>Forget it.. This is strange, bizar, abstract, weird, every other word that means the same as those (but in a good way). I think the key to your sucesfully bizard photo is the composition, or the amazingly odd colors. <br/> <br/>Damned it, that was a long commment... I''ll give you a good score though =)</td>', 'My first thought: "WTF?"My second thoght: "Is this an abstraction?"My third thought: "Is that a flying bug?"My fourth thought: "Is this an abstraction of a flying bug?"My fifth thought: "wtf..." I don''t know what to say.. If you have edited it some, then there''s no other way to do it. You''ve taken your photo and done the best you possibly could do with the outcome. Strangest thing, IT LOOKS AWESOME! I''m thinking: maybe black and white? nah... won''t work.. Looks like an old horror movie, sepiatoning then? nah... Forget it.. This is strange, bizar, abstract, weird, every other word that means the same as those (but in a good way). I think the key to your sucesfully bizard photo is the composition, or the amazingly odd colors.  Damned it, that was a long commment... I''ll give you a good score though =)', '2009-12-01 10:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748159, 836831, 100773, '<td valign="top">And here all of you bald eagle freeks are again with your thousand of eagles nesting in your backyard WHEN I HAVEN''T SEEN AS MUCH AS AN EAGLY IN MY LIFE! And aparantly there are many of them about where I live! Unfair that is... good score I give you to... But, the next time, why won''t you go over to the bald eagle, put a flash right next to it TO EASE UP THE SHADOWS!!!! (don''t worry, you''re not the first one I''m going after because of a good bald eagle shot =) )</td>', 'And here all of you bald eagle freeks are again with your thousand of eagles nesting in your backyard WHEN I HAVEN''T SEEN AS MUCH AS AN EAGLY IN MY LIFE! And aparantly there are many of them about where I live! Unfair that is... good score I give you to... But, the next time, why won''t you go over to the bald eagle, put a flash right next to it TO EASE UP THE SHADOWS!!!! (don''t worry, you''re not the first one I''m going after because of a good bald eagle shot =) )', '2009-12-01 10:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
