(5748174, 834603, 100773, '<td valign="top">He looks like the bald eagle that looks the other way when he''s flying, and then hits a big tree. the other eagles going like: "HEY! HARVEY!" Harvey''s like: "HUH?" BANG! Nevermind me... Commenting to much. Beautifull photo this is</td>', 'He looks like the bald eagle that looks the other way when he''s flying, and then hits a big tree. the other eagles going like: "HEY! HARVEY!" Harvey''s like: "HUH?" BANG! Nevermind me... Commenting to much. Beautifull photo this is', '2009-12-01 10:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
