(5748177, 836905, 100773, '<td valign="top">A nice panoramic feel, but I miss alot of the sky which you could''ve added and still have the panorama feel.</td>', 'A nice panoramic feel, but I miss alot of the sky which you could''ve added and still have the panorama feel.', '2009-12-01 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748179, 836783, 100773, '<td valign="top">Is it "in" to have a polaroid feel on photos? 2nd one I''ve seen on 27 images. It''s a darned fine photo anyway thoug, and the polaroid effect suits it very well!</td>', 'Is it "in" to have a polaroid feel on photos? 2nd one I''ve seen on 27 images. It''s a darned fine photo anyway thoug, and the polaroid effect suits it very well!', '2009-12-01 10:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748180, 835488, 106109, '<td valign="top">Red-tailed? Well done.</td>', 'Red-tailed? Well done.', '2009-12-01 10:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748182, 835350, 106109, '<td valign="top">The slight vignetting bothers me a little, but a very cute photo. Good luck.</td>', 'The slight vignetting bothers me a little, but a very cute photo. Good luck.', '2009-12-01 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748183, 836046, 83845, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Great lighting!</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Great lighting!', '2009-12-01 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748184, 833822, 106109, '<td valign="top">The like the white on white, but this looks like it has a slight blue color cast to me.</td>', 'The like the white on white, but this looks like it has a slight blue color cast to me.', '2009-12-01 10:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748188, 836741, 83845, '<td valign="top">This is a beauty in sooo many ways.  The mountains look so vast!</td>', 'This is a beauty in sooo many ways.  The mountains look so vast!', '2009-12-01 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748190, 835140, 100773, '<td valign="top">One quiet morning she sat naked on your chair like that? Tell me, where do you live? :p<br/> <br/>This is a nice photo! Toning is great, but I think you could''ve used a lower aperture to get the legs in focus as well (I''ve seen others shoot at f/16 and around there to get everything in focus) unless you were goig for this look which is fine, and maybe some light in her face?<br/> <br/><i>If you are a man and you feel you forgot some of your phototech. stuff, then you have to forgive yourself.. that was, sort of a, compliment, for the, model..</i></td>', 'One quiet morning she sat naked on your chair like that? Tell me, where do you live? :p This is a nice photo! Toning is great, but I think you could''ve used a lower aperture to get the legs in focus as well (I''ve seen others shoot at f/16 and around there to get everything in focus) unless you were goig for this look which is fine, and maybe some light in her face? If you are a man and you feel you forgot some of your phototech. stuff, then you have to forgive yourself.. that was, sort of a, compliment, for the, model..', '2009-12-01 10:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748193, 836805, 100773, '<td valign="top">Ain''t a ship in the night? Great and mystical photo!</td>', 'Ain''t a ship in the night? Great and mystical photo!', '2009-12-01 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748194, 834054, 83845, '<td valign="top">A beautiful area!!  The wall in the corner may distract a little from the composition.  The sky is beautiful.</td>', 'A beautiful area!!  The wall in the corner may distract a little from the composition.  The sky is beautiful.', '2009-12-01 10:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748196, 836832, 106109, '<td valign="top">I doubt if most people will know what a difficult shot this was. Nice capture.</td>', 'I doubt if most people will know what a difficult shot this was. Nice capture.', '2009-12-01 10:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748202, 835739, 83845, '<td valign="top">The lighting may be a tad harsh, but the expression is genuine.  I still can''t help but to want to see the eyes.</td>', 'The lighting may be a tad harsh, but the expression is genuine.  I still can''t help but to want to see the eyes.', '2009-12-01 10:38:54.000000', NULL, 1);
