(5748525, 836852, 28427, '<td valign="top">Feeling a bit down at the moment but this one made me smile spontaneously.  Thank you.</td>', 'Feeling a bit down at the moment but this one made me smile spontaneously.  Thank you.', '2009-12-01 13:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748530, 833597, 13688, '<td valign="top">This has to be the most thought provoking submission for me so far, perhaps that makes it the most artful.  I''m left wondering if there were enough clues provided and I''m a bit slow or if the details were intentionally left vague enough to make formulating a rational solution impossible.  So I''m left wondering the true intent of the photographer.  Perhaps the thought of nature overcoming man or that we could possibly overcome our destructive selves is an absurdity.</td>', 'This has to be the most thought provoking submission for me so far, perhaps that makes it the most artful.  I''m left wondering if there were enough clues provided and I''m a bit slow or if the details were intentionally left vague enough to make formulating a rational solution impossible.  So I''m left wondering the true intent of the photographer.  Perhaps the thought of nature overcoming man or that we could possibly overcome our destructive selves is an absurdity.', '2009-12-01 14:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748536, 836081, 43774, '<td valign="top">Really wish the beak and eye were in focus, the focus seems to be on the feathers on the body and not the head.</td>', 'Really wish the beak and eye were in focus, the focus seems to be on the feathers on the body and not the head.', '2009-12-01 14:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748538, 835568, 43774, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice building in the distance. I would have walked up past that car on the left and composed my shot from there. Right now there''s too much empty road that is not adding anything to the photo and the car is a distraction. You''ve got good exposure on this night shot, I like that there''s some blue left in the sky and the scene is a nice one.</td>', 'That''s a nice building in the distance. I would have walked up past that car on the left and composed my shot from there. Right now there''s too much empty road that is not adding anything to the photo and the car is a distraction. You''ve got good exposure on this night shot, I like that there''s some blue left in the sky and the scene is a nice one.', '2009-12-01 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5748539, 834865, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, good colours. The lights seem a little blurred, maybe from overexposure or slight movement in the camera.</td>', 'Nice scene, good colours. The lights seem a little blurred, maybe from overexposure or slight movement in the camera.', '2009-12-01 14:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
