(5748593, 836175, 43774, '<td valign="top">HDR? It has that flat HDR look that I don''t like. Too much grain in the sky and some sensor dust that you should either clone out or get rid of by cleaning your sensor.<br/> <br/>But a nice scene.</td>', 'HDR? It has that flat HDR look that I don''t like. Too much grain in the sky and some sensor dust that you should either clone out or get rid of by cleaning your sensor. But a nice scene.', '2009-12-01 14:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
