(5748714, 836827, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: Quite something to pull off a pet portrait and make it edgy. I love the paucity of colour here and the focus and composition is fantastic. I really like the umbrella catchlights too!<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: A great image - I wouldn''t have expected to like a cat picture as much as this.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: Quite something to pull off a pet portrait and make it edgy. I love the paucity of colour here and the focus and composition is fantastic. I really like the umbrella catchlights too! Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: A great image - I wouldn''t have expected to like a cat picture as much as this.', '2009-12-01 15:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
