(5748742, 836599, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives:This is a very well crafted image which benefits from great clarity and a bold composition. The mirrored surface offers a great reflection which make the board look like a Flash Gordon rocket! You''ve captured a real feeling here - looking at the image makes me want to take a deep breath and smell the sea air.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The very simple composition may not have enough immediate ''ooomph'' for rapid-fire voters so I hope they pause long enough to soak in the atmosphere.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very clean and fresh image - overall, extremely effective.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives:This is a very well crafted image which benefits from great clarity and a bold composition. The mirrored surface offers a great reflection which make the board look like a Flash Gordon rocket! You''ve captured a real feeling here - looking at the image makes me want to take a deep breath and smell the sea air. Critical stuff: The very simple composition may not have enough immediate ''ooomph'' for rapid-fire voters so I hope they pause long enough to soak in the atmosphere. Overall: A very clean and fresh image - overall, extremely effective.', '2009-12-01 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
