(5748771, 835746, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: So many great elements here - the interesting shape of the silhouette, the sharp flowers, the dramatic sky, the wonderful sun and even the contrail / cirrus strip.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I''m not sure whether I like the small highlights in the foreground but I suspect this is a good call and that pure block black here wouldn''t look as good.<br/> <br/>Overall:  This is an image that gets better and better the longer I look at it and it was pretty good to begin with. 10 and a fav.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: So many great elements here - the interesting shape of the silhouette, the sharp flowers, the dramatic sky, the wonderful sun and even the contrail / cirrus strip. Critical stuff: I''m not sure whether I like the small highlights in the foreground but I suspect this is a good call and that pure block black here wouldn''t look as good. Overall:  This is an image that gets better and better the longer I look at it and it was pretty good to begin with. 10 and a fav.', '2009-12-01 16:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
