(5748831, 833512, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: Wow, what an atmospheric image - the selective focus and monochrome tones work so well with this nostalgic scene. The crispness of the house is particularly compelling. Compositionally, I really like how you have offered a lot of negative space at the bottom.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Superb stuff - I could be wrong but I wonder whether this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RKT</a></td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: Wow, what an atmospheric image - the selective focus and monochrome tones work so well with this nostalgic scene. The crispness of the house is particularly compelling. Compositionally, I really like how you have offered a lot of negative space at the bottom. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Superb stuff - I could be wrong but I wonder whether this is  RKT', '2009-12-01 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
