(5748861, 834792, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives:Had to stop and comment on this one! Very bold! I like the superimposition of the lamp posts and the general dereliction.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: If I''m honest I think the low contrast of the image doesn''t make the most of the scene - which is a shame.<br/> <br/>Overall: I do like this scene, I''m just not sure you''ve optimised the image.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives:Had to stop and comment on this one! Very bold! I like the superimposition of the lamp posts and the general dereliction. Critical stuff: If I''m honest I think the low contrast of the image doesn''t make the most of the scene - which is a shame. Overall: I do like this scene, I''m just not sure you''ve optimised the image.', '2009-12-01 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
