(5750062, 836044, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene and the composition is well done but I am really not a fan of overprocessing. I think that if the changes to this photo were set at 50%-70% opacity over the original it would probably have been just right. Beautifully lit with nice colors without looking fake.</td>', 'This is a nice scene and the composition is well done but I am really not a fan of overprocessing. I think that if the changes to this photo were set at 50%-70% opacity over the original it would probably have been just right. Beautifully lit with nice colors without looking fake.', '2009-12-02 10:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
