(5750153, 833272, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, this has potential...here are somethings that bother "me" (like I count) dead center, tilted horizon, shadows on the steer''s face...IMO I think I would have cropped so that the steer is either left or right and filled the frame more...I like the processing although</td>', 'ok, this has potential...here are somethings that bother "me" (like I count) dead center, tilted horizon, shadows on the steer''s face...IMO I think I would have cropped so that the steer is either left or right and filled the frame more...I like the processing although', '2009-12-02 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750162, 833236, 98339, '<td valign="top">pretty horse....I think (not sure) but if you had pushed your hue and saturation before you converted to the B&amp;W your tones would have been richer.  This is something that I recently discovered when I am converting a picture to B&amp;W</td>', 'pretty horse....I think (not sure) but if you had pushed your hue and saturation before you converted to the B&W your tones would have been richer.  This is something that I recently discovered when I am converting a picture to B&W', '2009-12-02 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
