(5750184, 834983, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, here are a couple of things that bother me...let me first start with what I like...your colors and tones are spot on...your lighting is very good.  BUT your slumping...straighten that back, pull those shoulders back...find your spine...(you have that computer "slump")..I even like your expression.  Those 2 things on the position of your body will send out a totally different message...(just MHO, I''m a mother what do you expect...lol)</td>', 'ok, here are a couple of things that bother me...let me first start with what I like...your colors and tones are spot on...your lighting is very good.  BUT your slumping...straighten that back, pull those shoulders back...find your spine...(you have that computer "slump")..I even like your expression.  Those 2 things on the position of your body will send out a totally different message...(just MHO, I''m a mother what do you expect...lol)', '2009-12-02 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
