(5750975, 836718, 38930, '<td valign="top">Not a bad start.  I would suggest taking it more from the side, and exposing your image for just a little longer so it''s brighter.  Cool lamp!</td>', 'Not a bad start.  I would suggest taking it more from the side, and exposing your image for just a little longer so it''s brighter.  Cool lamp!', '2009-12-02 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750976, 836775, 38930, '<td valign="top">It''s pretty weird to see the snow and sunset together like this... it''s almost like half black and white, and half color.  Weird, but cool.  Nice work!</td>', 'It''s pretty weird to see the snow and sunset together like this... it''s almost like half black and white, and half color.  Weird, but cool.  Nice work!', '2009-12-02 17:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750977, 836258, 38930, '<td valign="top">Awesome toning!  Have you tried it without the black border?  The blue at the top is competing with the black line, so it might look better without it.  Great job tho!</td>', 'Awesome toning!  Have you tried it without the black border?  The blue at the top is competing with the black line, so it might look better without it.  Great job tho!', '2009-12-02 17:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750980, 836664, 38930, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I really like the overexposure, and the only thing I would change is the shadow on her neck.  Great shot!</td>', 'Awesome!  I really like the overexposure, and the only thing I would change is the shadow on her neck.  Great shot!', '2009-12-02 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750982, 835962, 38930, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot and great toning!  The only thing that bugs me is the tree "growing" out of the roof of the car.  If you bent your knees a little and shot lower, that would''ve hidden the trees behind the car.  Besides that, great job!  Everything from the front tires being turned, to the yellow car against a blue scene... it works great.</td>', 'Awesome shot and great toning!  The only thing that bugs me is the tree "growing" out of the roof of the car.  If you bent your knees a little and shot lower, that would''ve hidden the trees behind the car.  Besides that, great job!  Everything from the front tires being turned, to the yellow car against a blue scene... it works great.', '2009-12-02 17:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750984, 835569, 38930, '<td valign="top">This seems like such a nice place! The picture looks a little out of focus, but this would be an awesome place to come back to during sunrise or sunset.  Great find!</td>', 'This seems like such a nice place! The picture looks a little out of focus, but this would be an awesome place to come back to during sunrise or sunset.  Great find!', '2009-12-02 17:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
