(5751592, 834625, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this stark B&amp;W landscape. The leading lines of the fenceline and the road draw me into the country. The sky is nicely dramatic. Maybe the reason I like it is because it reminds me of home in Montana ... but for whatever reason, I do like it.</td>', 'I like this stark B&W landscape. The leading lines of the fenceline and the road draw me into the country. The sky is nicely dramatic. Maybe the reason I like it is because it reminds me of home in Montana ... but for whatever reason, I do like it.', '2009-12-02 23:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751594, 835488, 18197, '<td valign="top">Splendid image, nicely captured, and presented. Color saturation is terrific. Composition is very good (maybe just a little tight at the top). Among the best images I''ve seen so far in voting the challenge.</td>', 'Splendid image, nicely captured, and presented. Color saturation is terrific. Composition is very good (maybe just a little tight at the top). Among the best images I''ve seen so far in voting the challenge.', '2009-12-02 23:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751595, 834214, 18197, '<td valign="top">This won''t be to everyone''s taste. For some too processed. For some too sharp. For me ... a splendid image. I love how the animals seem to glow. Really brings them forward and sets them apart from the background.</td>', 'This won''t be to everyone''s taste. For some too processed. For some too sharp. For me ... a splendid image. I love how the animals seem to glow. Really brings them forward and sets them apart from the background.', '2009-12-02 23:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751596, 836686, 18197, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Skagit County eagle. Great moment. Great capture. Well focused and presented.</td>', 'Looks like a Skagit County eagle. Great moment. Great capture. Well focused and presented.', '2009-12-02 23:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751598, 836310, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the pastel colors, reflection, composition and presentation. Might love it more with more contrast ... but then it might lose its etherial quality. Well done.</td>', 'Love the pastel colors, reflection, composition and presentation. Might love it more with more contrast ... but then it might lose its etherial quality. Well done.', '2009-12-02 23:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751599, 836807, 18197, '<td valign="top">I grew up in a place not dissimilar from this and it reminds me of home. Thanks for the nostalgia trip!</td>', 'I grew up in a place not dissimilar from this and it reminds me of home. Thanks for the nostalgia trip!', '2009-12-02 23:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751600, 836661, 18197, '<td valign="top">Touching emotional moment. Thanks.</td>', 'Touching emotional moment. Thanks.', '2009-12-02 23:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751602, 836650, 18197, '<td valign="top">The thing I find interesting here is the juxtaposition of bright framing element and darker subject image. Well imagined and captured. Light levels in shadow are good. Light levels in sunlight too. Not that easy. Well done.</td>', 'The thing I find interesting here is the juxtaposition of bright framing element and darker subject image. Well imagined and captured. Light levels in shadow are good. Light levels in sunlight too. Not that easy. Well done.', '2009-12-02 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751603, 836845, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl well captured in your photo. Love her expression and the emotion you''ve captured. Your post processing gives me pause. Too much? I''m unsure. But I''m sure it''s a great photo.</td>', 'Beautiful girl well captured in your photo. Love her expression and the emotion you''ve captured. Your post processing gives me pause. Too much? I''m unsure. But I''m sure it''s a great photo.', '2009-12-03 00:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751604, 836715, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. If I were traveling by train, I''d love to be going through country this pretty. Nice work.</td>', 'Aptly titled. If I were traveling by train, I''d love to be going through country this pretty. Nice work.', '2009-12-03 00:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751605, 836859, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I like the star artifacts around the lights. I like the dreamy sky. I like the subject, the colors, the processing. I''d like it all a bit more if it were straightened in the frame, but possibly that''s a nit. Great work!</td>', 'Fantastic! I like the star artifacts around the lights. I like the dreamy sky. I like the subject, the colors, the processing. I''d like it all a bit more if it were straightened in the frame, but possibly that''s a nit. Great work!', '2009-12-03 00:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751606, 836846, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely, dreamy image. Sepia treatment seems to work well here. Good choice.</td>', 'Lovely, dreamy image. Sepia treatment seems to work well here. Good choice.', '2009-12-03 00:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751607, 834863, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is SO hard. I''ve tried this many times but your results are so much better''n mine. Great work!</td>', 'This is SO hard. I''ve tried this many times but your results are so much better''n mine. Great work!', '2009-12-03 00:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751608, 836831, 18197, '<td valign="top">Simply outstanding. I really like the setting and composition, but what I like best is the definition of the feathers. GREAT work.</td>', 'Simply outstanding. I really like the setting and composition, but what I like best is the definition of the feathers. GREAT work.', '2009-12-03 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751610, 836395, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the way you''ve captured the reflections. It''s a pretty, natural scene and you''ve made the most of it.</td>', 'I love the way you''ve captured the reflections. It''s a pretty, natural scene and you''ve made the most of it.', '2009-12-03 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751611, 836902, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Fall day, I''d like to be here. Nicely rendered colors and dreamy water.</td>', 'Beautiful Fall day, I''d like to be here. Nicely rendered colors and dreamy water.', '2009-12-03 00:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751612, 836723, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great photo of this iconic landmark ... rarely done better.</td>', 'Great photo of this iconic landmark ... rarely done better.', '2009-12-03 00:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751614, 836897, 18197, '<td valign="top">A little dark on my calibrated monitor but it''s night, doh! I''m glad you caught some stars. And I''m glad you caught the emotion of the place. Good work.</td>', 'A little dark on my calibrated monitor but it''s night, doh! I''m glad you caught some stars. And I''m glad you caught the emotion of the place. Good work.', '2009-12-03 00:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751615, 836025, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your title is apt. I <u>feel</u> swept away! Interesting focus contributes to the feeling!</td>', 'Your title is apt. I feel swept away! Interesting focus contributes to the feeling!', '2009-12-03 00:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751618, 836920, 18197, '<td valign="top">I know this place! I''ve stood here and attempted this very shot ... but you did it better. Until you''ve been here, it''s hard to appreciate the quality of light you captured ... the diffused high humidity light of this great city. I really like the dark u-shaped foreground. it sets the city off beautifully. Thanks!</td>', 'I know this place! I''ve stood here and attempted this very shot ... but you did it better. Until you''ve been here, it''s hard to appreciate the quality of light you captured ... the diffused high humidity light of this great city. I really like the dark u-shaped foreground. it sets the city off beautifully. Thanks!', '2009-12-03 00:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751620, 836668, 18197, '<td valign="top">Superb. I''ve shot this from the Bund side but I like yours better. And the motion blur of a passing ship is GREAT! Among the best photos I''ve seen this challenge.</td>', 'Superb. I''ve shot this from the Bund side but I like yours better. And the motion blur of a passing ship is GREAT! Among the best photos I''ve seen this challenge.', '2009-12-03 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
