(5751638, 836874, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love this starkly abstract image. You have the massive engineering of the bridge contrasted with the soft pastels of the sky and the analog shape of the water. Maybe pull a little yellow out of the water and you''ve got a ten here.</td>', 'I love this starkly abstract image. You have the massive engineering of the bridge contrasted with the soft pastels of the sky and the analog shape of the water. Maybe pull a little yellow out of the water and you''ve got a ten here.', '2009-12-03 00:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
