(5751645, 836765, 18197, '<td valign="top">Diamonds indeed. Diamonds on the soles of her shoes - as the bard says. Diamonds are forever - as Albert Broccoli would say, except he''s dead. I like it.</td>', 'Diamonds indeed. Diamonds on the soles of her shoes - as the bard says. Diamonds are forever - as Albert Broccoli would say, except he''s dead. I like it.', '2009-12-03 00:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
