(5751656, 832459, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am reminded of Tarzan movies where there''s a crocodile just outside the frame ready to eat Tarzan if he doesn''t swim fast enough. A fun nostalgia trip.</td>', 'I am reminded of Tarzan movies where there''s a crocodile just outside the frame ready to eat Tarzan if he doesn''t swim fast enough. A fun nostalgia trip.', '2009-12-03 00:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
