(5751686, 836069, 18197, '<td valign="top">Absolutely etherial. I really like that there is no real boundary between sky and water. I really like the stark subject against the pastel sky/water background. Among best in show.</td>', 'Absolutely etherial. I really like that there is no real boundary between sky and water. I really like the stark subject against the pastel sky/water background. Among best in show.', '2009-12-03 01:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
