(5751713, 836235, 18197, '<td valign="top">An absolutely superb still life of pear!!!!! Lighting is spectacular. Processing and presentation, too. An elegantly simple image among best of show.</td>', 'An absolutely superb still life of pear!!!!! Lighting is spectacular. Processing and presentation, too. An elegantly simple image among best of show.', '2009-12-03 01:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
