(5751726, 831846, 38930, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette! I actually pulled this file into Photoshop and added more contrast, and I think it looks a little better if the shadows were pure black.  Anyway, great job finding this scene and getting an awesome photo!</td>', 'Great silhouette! I actually pulled this file into Photoshop and added more contrast, and I think it looks a little better if the shadows were pure black.  Anyway, great job finding this scene and getting an awesome photo!', '2009-12-03 01:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
