(5751745, 835829, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is a great image on many levels. The child is perfectly seen and captured. I like that there are lots of birds in the air. What child hasn''t chased pigeons or seagulls? But I like even better that there are many birds still on the beach. Terrific! But watch the (unintentional?) tilt of the horizon. It detracts a bit. No worries, you''re getting a good score from me.</td>', 'This is a great image on many levels. The child is perfectly seen and captured. I like that there are lots of birds in the air. What child hasn''t chased pigeons or seagulls? But I like even better that there are many birds still on the beach. Terrific! But watch the (unintentional?) tilt of the horizon. It detracts a bit. No worries, you''re getting a good score from me.', '2009-12-03 01:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5751748, 836919, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely place. Interesting choice to feature the foreground rather than the background. It will be interesting to see how this does in the voting.</td>', 'Lovely place. Interesting choice to feature the foreground rather than the background. It will be interesting to see how this does in the voting.', '2009-12-03 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
