(5753386, 831713, 18197, '<td valign="top">Just when I think I''ll kill myself if I see another drop photo, one comes along that is so good it gives me a new lease on life. In this case, the pattern and colors in the coffee rescued me. Superb. White background is a bit stark.</td>', 'Just when I think I''ll kill myself if I see another drop photo, one comes along that is so good it gives me a new lease on life. In this case, the pattern and colors in the coffee rescued me. Superb. White background is a bit stark.', '2009-12-04 00:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
