(5754417, 836675, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute pic, but it comes off to me as more of a snapshot than as a candid portrait. Perhaps a different angle on the lighting could help, but I am not really sure. Sorry.</td>', 'A cute pic, but it comes off to me as more of a snapshot than as a candid portrait. Perhaps a different angle on the lighting could help, but I am not really sure. Sorry.', '2009-12-04 13:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754419, 836852, 83313, '<td valign="top">He''s seems to be saying: "Harrumph! Is THAT the best vote you can give me?"</td>', 'He''s seems to be saying: "Harrumph! Is THAT the best vote you can give me?"', '2009-12-04 13:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754425, 836669, 83313, '<td valign="top">There are some aspects of this scene I really like, such as the appearance of the pine trees in the distance. Good dimension to that. On the negative side, there is a visible tilt to the image and that is likely hurting it a lot. Also the foreground does not have much interest or oomph to it. I think cropping some off the bottom and fixing the tilt would make for some huge differences. There some good potential to this scene, however. If you choose to do a post-challenge reedit of this, I would love to see it.</td>', 'There are some aspects of this scene I really like, such as the appearance of the pine trees in the distance. Good dimension to that. On the negative side, there is a visible tilt to the image and that is likely hurting it a lot. Also the foreground does not have much interest or oomph to it. I think cropping some off the bottom and fixing the tilt would make for some huge differences. There some good potential to this scene, however. If you choose to do a post-challenge reedit of this, I would love to see it.', '2009-12-04 13:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754428, 835739, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think the closed eyes adds to the impression of happiness you are conveying. I am wondering, however, if you are getting killed in voting for it. Some could take it as a flaw. I''ll be curious to see where this places and to read others comments after the challenge.</td>', 'I think the closed eyes adds to the impression of happiness you are conveying. I am wondering, however, if you are getting killed in voting for it. Some could take it as a flaw. I''ll be curious to see where this places and to read others comments after the challenge.', '2009-12-04 13:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754430, 836069, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful minimalism. I think I am faving this one.</td>', 'Wonderful minimalism. I think I am faving this one.', '2009-12-04 13:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754433, 836598, 83313, '<td valign="top">Do you really need another comment on this? I''m sure they are piling up. A very different bug shot. I expect to see this entry near the top of the challenge.</td>', 'Do you really need another comment on this? I''m sure they are piling up. A very different bug shot. I expect to see this entry near the top of the challenge.', '2009-12-04 13:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754436, 835977, 83313, '<td valign="top">Quirky and unique. I like this a lot. There is just a teeny bit of perceptible tilt which is made visible because of all the right angles.</td>', 'Quirky and unique. I like this a lot. There is just a teeny bit of perceptible tilt which is made visible because of all the right angles.', '2009-12-04 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
