(5754640, 836158, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=61651" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">krnodil</a>-y and quite nostalgic on my part - my very first challenge entry featured a windmill and power lines.  It wasn''t nearly this creatively done, however!</td>', 'Very  krnodil-y and quite nostalgic on my part - my very first challenge entry featured a windmill and power lines.  It wasn''t nearly this creatively done, however!', '2009-12-04 16:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754641, 833193, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Very fun!</td>', 'LOL!  Very fun!', '2009-12-04 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754642, 836733, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is quite fun.  No idea what they''re doing, but it''s still fun!</td>', 'This is quite fun.  No idea what they''re doing, but it''s still fun!', '2009-12-04 16:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754645, 836665, 7778, '<td valign="top">Comment: <br/>Energy/Range/Story: 5/8/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/8 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical: 8/6 <br/>Presentation:5 <br/>Total: 6.4<br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: a fine Toscanesque with lovely natural tones and colour. Not a spectacular composition, but an emphatically appropriate one.<br/> <br/>The rich, furrowed soil, so dominant here, afford the viewer an expansive vanishing point made of the subtlest water colour gauze, through which he is to be encouraged to disappear. Magic, yet tangibly fresh! (And, there is, to my sense, no shape more beautiful than the arch, especially here).<br/> <br/>Symphony No. 6 in F major.</td>', 'Comment: Energy/Range/Story: 5/8/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/8 Aesthetics/Technical: 8/6 Presentation:5 Total: 6.4Vote: 6  Remarks: a fine Toscanesque with lovely natural tones and colour. Not a spectacular composition, but an emphatically appropriate one. The rich, furrowed soil, so dominant here, afford the viewer an expansive vanishing point made of the subtlest water colour gauze, through which he is to be encouraged to disappear. Magic, yet tangibly fresh! (And, there is, to my sense, no shape more beautiful than the arch, especially here). Symphony No. 6 in F major.', '2009-12-04 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
