(5754752, 833669, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning shot. I can''t put my finger on what it is that I like so much. Nice processing and the DOF is great. 10</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning shot. I can''t put my finger on what it is that I like so much. Nice processing and the DOF is great. 10', '2009-12-04 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
