(5754864, 836797, 18197, '<td valign="top">Cute kid in  a nice setting. I can easily see this in an intimate Christmas photo card. Nice work.</td>', 'Cute kid in  a nice setting. I can easily see this in an intimate Christmas photo card. Nice work.', '2009-12-04 21:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754865, 833149, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Well imagined. Terrific color. Crop feels a little tight.</td>', 'Great subject. Well imagined. Terrific color. Crop feels a little tight.', '2009-12-04 21:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754866, 835950, 18197, '<td valign="top">I would LOVE to be walking here. What a great feeling of freedom. Thanks.</td>', 'I would LOVE to be walking here. What a great feeling of freedom. Thanks.', '2009-12-04 21:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754867, 836664, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am a child of the 60''s. And this feels 60''s nostalgic. Beautiful girl, long rebellious hair, funky (possibly home made) jewelry and a sense of innocence. Well done.</td>', 'I am a child of the 60''s. And this feels 60''s nostalgic. Beautiful girl, long rebellious hair, funky (possibly home made) jewelry and a sense of innocence. Well done.', '2009-12-04 21:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754868, 833310, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your choice of B&amp;W here was inspired. Great composition, focus, clarity. Among best of show.</td>', 'Your choice of B&W here was inspired. Great composition, focus, clarity. Among best of show.', '2009-12-04 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754870, 836257, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your title nailed the feeling of the photo. Feels serene. Love the fence posts on the horizon line.</td>', 'Your title nailed the feeling of the photo. Feels serene. Love the fence posts on the horizon line.', '2009-12-04 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754872, 835578, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think of Mexico as wildly vibrant and your photo reinforces that feeling. Thanks.</td>', 'I think of Mexico as wildly vibrant and your photo reinforces that feeling. Thanks.', '2009-12-04 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754875, 831478, 18197, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I am having trouble processing this photo. I like the shapes, the colors, the composition ... but I''m having trouble figuring out what I''m seeing. I like the sharp background and the soft foreground. It''s my failure to understand.</td>', 'To be honest, I am having trouble processing this photo. I like the shapes, the colors, the composition ... but I''m having trouble figuring out what I''m seeing. I like the sharp background and the soft foreground. It''s my failure to understand.', '2009-12-04 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754876, 836254, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Colors, comp, focus, detail ... everything.</td>', 'Brilliant. Colors, comp, focus, detail ... everything.', '2009-12-04 21:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754877, 836665, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love this foggy composition. The leading lines do a fantastic job of drawing me into the photo.</td>', 'Love this foggy composition. The leading lines do a fantastic job of drawing me into the photo.', '2009-12-04 21:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754884, 836003, 18197, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very high emotional payload which I quite like. The eyes are a bit creepy. What''s going on with the earring? And the glimpse of the white collar. The low key. Feels like John Malkovich! A fine photo I''ll be watching for in the top 10 in the voting.</td>', 'This photo has a very high emotional payload which I quite like. The eyes are a bit creepy. What''s going on with the earring? And the glimpse of the white collar. The low key. Feels like John Malkovich! A fine photo I''ll be watching for in the top 10 in the voting.', '2009-12-04 21:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754885, 833187, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely, lovely! Among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely, lovely! Among my favorites this challenge.', '2009-12-04 21:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754887, 836805, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract nature of your photo. The star artifacts are terrific. Very very well done.</td>', 'I love the abstract nature of your photo. The star artifacts are terrific. Very very well done.', '2009-12-04 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754889, 835727, 18197, '<td valign="top">Fun. I love throwing rocks into water. High key and selective desat are effective.</td>', 'Fun. I love throwing rocks into water. High key and selective desat are effective.', '2009-12-04 21:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754892, 834616, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like photos that show me a new take on the things I''ve seen, but sadly this doesn''t. Still, it''s a well executed workmanlike photo. Focus is good. Color and exposure are good. I like the star artifacts around the lights. I like the ridgeline lights. I''ll be watching for you to take your mastery of camera and processing to subjects I''ll resonate with to a greater extent.</td>', 'I like photos that show me a new take on the things I''ve seen, but sadly this doesn''t. Still, it''s a well executed workmanlike photo. Focus is good. Color and exposure are good. I like the star artifacts around the lights. I like the ridgeline lights. I''ll be watching for you to take your mastery of camera and processing to subjects I''ll resonate with to a greater extent.', '2009-12-04 21:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754895, 836500, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really love orchids and this is an unusual specimen. Great subject. Great background, dof, bokeh. Interesting composition. Well done.</td>', 'I really love orchids and this is an unusual specimen. Great subject. Great background, dof, bokeh. Interesting composition. Well done.', '2009-12-04 21:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754896, 836749, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here, at this time of day, and attempted to photograph it. But you''ve done it better than me! Well done.</td>', 'I''ve been here, at this time of day, and attempted to photograph it. But you''ve done it better than me! Well done.', '2009-12-04 21:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754897, 835189, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the high key, composition and energy.</td>', 'Love the high key, composition and energy.', '2009-12-04 21:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754899, 836621, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is exceptional. My current pick for best in show. Not sure about the letterbox framing, but am sure about the rest.</td>', 'Oh, this is exceptional. My current pick for best in show. Not sure about the letterbox framing, but am sure about the rest.', '2009-12-04 21:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754902, 836739, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Colors are great. Reflections, especially. Composition. A pleasing addition to this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Colors are great. Reflections, especially. Composition. A pleasing addition to this challenge.', '2009-12-04 21:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754905, 836158, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hmm ... not sure what you''re going for, what you''re trying to tell me through the photo. Colors are good, the blurred focus contributes energy.</td>', 'Hmm ... not sure what you''re going for, what you''re trying to tell me through the photo. Colors are good, the blurred focus contributes energy.', '2009-12-04 21:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754907, 836062, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed. Wonderful contrast. Great DOF. I like this.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed. Wonderful contrast. Great DOF. I like this.', '2009-12-04 21:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5754909, 836702, 18197, '<td valign="top">Terrific! Imagination, execution, post processing. Among best in show.</td>', 'Terrific! Imagination, execution, post processing. Among best in show.', '2009-12-04 21:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
