(5755242, 836912, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly exposed, saturated, presented seascape. I wouldn''t mind sitting here awhile just to soak it up. Thanks.</td>', 'Brilliantly exposed, saturated, presented seascape. I wouldn''t mind sitting here awhile just to soak it up. Thanks.', '2009-12-05 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755243, 835429, 18197, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like the surreal manufactured images such as this, but if you''re going to do it, you might as well do it as well as this has been done. Not to my taste, and maybe with a limited market, but well done.</td>', 'I don''t usually like the surreal manufactured images such as this, but if you''re going to do it, you might as well do it as well as this has been done. Not to my taste, and maybe with a limited market, but well done.', '2009-12-05 01:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755270, 836183, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''d love to be hiking/climbing here. What a lovely place and well captured and presented.</td>', 'I''d love to be hiking/climbing here. What a lovely place and well captured and presented.', '2009-12-05 02:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755271, 835192, 18197, '<td valign="top">Ha! I like your title. Rally racing is such greet fun! Terrific image!</td>', 'Ha! I like your title. Rally racing is such greet fun! Terrific image!', '2009-12-05 02:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755272, 836180, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels very holiday-like. I can see this commercially in magazine ads, billboards, etc. Well done.</td>', 'Feels very holiday-like. I can see this commercially in magazine ads, billboards, etc. Well done.', '2009-12-05 02:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755274, 836327, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the high key nature of this. Nice focus on the eyes.</td>', 'I like the high key nature of this. Nice focus on the eyes.', '2009-12-05 02:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755276, 835720, 18197, '<td valign="top">Splendid detailed photo. I wish I could do this well. Your DOF is superb and gives us a wonderful pastel background to set off the bird. GREAT!</td>', 'Splendid detailed photo. I wish I could do this well. Your DOF is superb and gives us a wonderful pastel background to set off the bird. GREAT!', '2009-12-05 02:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755278, 835966, 18197, '<td valign="top">You caught her personality and made me feel her energy and (I suspect), her mischievous nature.</td>', 'You caught her personality and made me feel her energy and (I suspect), her mischievous nature.', '2009-12-05 02:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755282, 836758, 18197, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful scene. The mist is perfect. The detail and contrast of the rock if appealing. The flowing water is etherial. Great photo. Among best in show.</td>', 'Really beautiful scene. The mist is perfect. The detail and contrast of the rock if appealing. The flowing water is etherial. Great photo. Among best in show.', '2009-12-05 02:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755283, 836667, 18197, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought it would be possible to lend an element of whimsey to this stark memorial, but you have. The world needs more whimsey. Thanks.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought it would be possible to lend an element of whimsey to this stark memorial, but you have. The world needs more whimsey. Thanks.', '2009-12-05 02:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755286, 831232, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this. The composition, subject are very very good. The colors and the execution overall is very good. Nice work.</td>', 'I like this. The composition, subject are very very good. The colors and the execution overall is very good. Nice work.', '2009-12-05 02:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755288, 836750, 18197, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Thanks.</td>', 'Made me smile. Thanks.', '2009-12-05 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755289, 835581, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m seeing. It''s hard for me to process this and develop a point of view. But it succeeds as an abstract.</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m seeing. It''s hard for me to process this and develop a point of view. But it succeeds as an abstract.', '2009-12-05 02:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755295, 836695, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels like a "Spirit of a Country" out take. Interesting juxtaposition of sport and patriotism. I like your precise control over focus ... not so easy.</td>', 'Feels like a "Spirit of a Country" out take. Interesting juxtaposition of sport and patriotism. I like your precise control over focus ... not so easy.', '2009-12-05 02:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755299, 836810, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed photo. I like the very high contrast without blowing the details of the dress.</td>', 'Beautifully composed photo. I like the very high contrast without blowing the details of the dress.', '2009-12-05 02:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755301, 836772, 18197, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, color and presentation are superb. Damn, I wish I lived in Iceland.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, color and presentation are superb. Damn, I wish I lived in Iceland.', '2009-12-05 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755303, 836820, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is creepy ... waiting for the dark prince indeed. Reminds me of the feeling I get reading a Steven King novel ... "It," for example. Even the rustic frame works! Terrific emotional payload. Among best in show.</td>', 'This is creepy ... waiting for the dark prince indeed. Reminds me of the feeling I get reading a Steven King novel ... "It," for example. Even the rustic frame works! Terrific emotional payload. Among best in show.', '2009-12-05 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755305, 836675, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the energy here. Maybe move the girl a bit forward from the wall she''s standing in front of to manage the shadows.</td>', 'Love the energy here. Maybe move the girl a bit forward from the wall she''s standing in front of to manage the shadows.', '2009-12-05 02:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755307, 835591, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels like the Tetons. If so, I grew up near here. I love the scene, the lighting, the composition. Great work.</td>', 'Feels like the Tetons. If so, I grew up near here. I love the scene, the lighting, the composition. Great work.', '2009-12-05 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755308, 836783, 18197, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but I can''t put my finger on why. Nicely captured and presented. Very strong focus.</td>', 'I do like this, but I can''t put my finger on why. Nicely captured and presented. Very strong focus.', '2009-12-05 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755311, 834132, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have seen this, or something like it before. The details you''ve captured are appealing. The tilt of her head and her lips gives this a personality and an attitude I quite like.</td>', 'I have seen this, or something like it before. The details you''ve captured are appealing. The tilt of her head and her lips gives this a personality and an attitude I quite like.', '2009-12-05 02:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755312, 834574, 18197, '<td valign="top">I cannot imagine a more perfect land/sky-scape. Essentially perfect!</td>', 'I cannot imagine a more perfect land/sky-scape. Essentially perfect!', '2009-12-05 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755314, 836064, 56579, '<td valign="top">Love the photo!</td>', 'Love the photo!', '2009-12-05 02:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755315, 835817, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''ve been all over the world and I have seen and learned to love passages like this. Well captured and presented. Thanks for the nostalgia trip.<br/>ETA: Cool - Croatia. I''ve been to Split and Zagreb and the Islands of Vis and Hvar but not to Dubrovnik. Now, I''m sorry I missed it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-29 02:25:40.</i></td>', 'I''ve been all over the world and I have seen and learned to love passages like this. Well captured and presented. Thanks for the nostalgia trip.ETA: Cool - Croatia. I''ve been to Split and Zagreb and the Islands of Vis and Hvar but not to Dubrovnik. Now, I''m sorry I missed it!', '2009-12-05 02:40:49.000000', '2009-12-29 02:25:40.000000', 1),
(5755316, 833370, 56579, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, the eyes are sharp and the DOF is perfect</td>', 'Love the photo, the eyes are sharp and the DOF is perfect', '2009-12-05 02:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755318, 836132, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is just about the hardest photo I can imagine taking. The black fur is fundamentally hard to bring out detail in without blowing out the rest. Super job with this. You''ve managed to convey something of the dog''s personality (do dogs have personality?) Great work.</td>', 'This is just about the hardest photo I can imagine taking. The black fur is fundamentally hard to bring out detail in without blowing out the rest. Super job with this. You''ve managed to convey something of the dog''s personality (do dogs have personality?) Great work.', '2009-12-05 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755319, 836235, 56579, '<td valign="top">I think a 1/3 or 1/2 stop more exposure would really bring out the texture better</td>', 'I think a 1/3 or 1/2 stop more exposure would really bring out the texture better', '2009-12-05 02:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755320, 836910, 18197, '<td valign="top">Damn. Yet another drop photo ... but so good I have to give it a great score for it''s color, contrast, detail and energy. I hate this genre but am drawn to the best of its photos. Great work!</td>', 'Damn. Yet another drop photo ... but so good I have to give it a great score for it''s color, contrast, detail and energy. I hate this genre but am drawn to the best of its photos. Great work!', '2009-12-05 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755323, 834431, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like the vintage look of this. The round glasses and pipe contribute to this. As does the framing. Beautifully done.</td>', 'I really like the vintage look of this. The round glasses and pipe contribute to this. As does the framing. Beautifully done.', '2009-12-05 02:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755324, 836167, 18197, '<td valign="top">I know Sloan Square and this bus. Well captured and presented. And thanks for the nostalgia trip.</td>', 'I know Sloan Square and this bus. Well captured and presented. And thanks for the nostalgia trip.', '2009-12-05 02:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755325, 835569, 56579, '<td valign="top">Needs more focus</td>', 'Needs more focus', '2009-12-05 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755328, 833882, 18197, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Beach Boys "Little Deuce Coup." Love the car, the setting, the processing and the photo.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Beach Boys "Little Deuce Coup." Love the car, the setting, the processing and the photo.', '2009-12-05 02:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755329, 835089, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. Well composed. Great reflections.</td>', 'Aptly titled. Well composed. Great reflections.', '2009-12-05 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755330, 836669, 56579, '<td valign="top">You don''t get a good grasp of the snow.  I think a high ISO and a speed of about 1/500, and the smallest aperture you can get is what I would have tried in a situation like this.<br/> <br/>Maybe zoom further forward, so you only see water, some sticks sticking out of the water in the foreground, and maybe get some more detail of the trees behind.</td>', 'You don''t get a good grasp of the snow.  I think a high ISO and a speed of about 1/500, and the smallest aperture you can get is what I would have tried in a situation like this. Maybe zoom further forward, so you only see water, some sticks sticking out of the water in the foreground, and maybe get some more detail of the trees behind.', '2009-12-05 02:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755332, 831694, 56579, '<td valign="top">Image is way too small, it looks like it was sharp, i would have loved to see those trees on the right in more detail.</td>', 'Image is way too small, it looks like it was sharp, i would have loved to see those trees on the right in more detail.', '2009-12-05 02:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755333, 835739, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this except the soft focus. I am sure you chose the softer focus on purpose and it works on several levels ... but if i could reshoot (reprocess) this, a crisper focus would improve it IMHO.</td>', 'I love everything about this except the soft focus. I am sure you chose the softer focus on purpose and it works on several levels ... but if i could reshoot (reprocess) this, a crisper focus would improve it IMHO.', '2009-12-05 02:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755334, 836694, 56579, '<td valign="top">With the person on the right looking very weird, the photo seems awkward.  I would have got it if the child looked scared.  I think the intense flash could have added to that creepy look.  But as the photo is currently, the elements just feel awkward and like it was an accident.</td>', 'With the person on the right looking very weird, the photo seems awkward.  I would have got it if the child looked scared.  I think the intense flash could have added to that creepy look.  But as the photo is currently, the elements just feel awkward and like it was an accident.', '2009-12-05 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755335, 836599, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a wonderful, surreal image. Absolutely gorgeous. Among best of show.</td>', 'Oh, what a wonderful, surreal image. Absolutely gorgeous. Among best of show.', '2009-12-05 02:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755339, 835952, 18197, '<td valign="top">WOW! What a magnificent bird! And how magnificently captured! I hope you''re proud of this image; it''s among the best in show in my opinion.</td>', 'WOW! What a magnificent bird! And how magnificently captured! I hope you''re proud of this image; it''s among the best in show in my opinion.', '2009-12-05 02:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755341, 836858, 18197, '<td valign="top">The world doesn''t have enough whimsey but i like very much you''ve added to our whimsey quotient. The tilted diagonal composition is superb. The light levels, focus, clarity ... are terrific. My best score so far this challenge!</td>', 'The world doesn''t have enough whimsey but i like very much you''ve added to our whimsey quotient. The tilted diagonal composition is superb. The light levels, focus, clarity ... are terrific. My best score so far this challenge!', '2009-12-05 02:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755343, 836264, 18197, '<td valign="top">Last time I stood on this spot, I was on a Segway. What a hoot, but I digress. This is an extraordinary image. The vignette and grain therein are wonderful. The wide angle distortion is wonderful. It''s an interesting subject. Details, focus and clarity are good. B&amp;W is good. Maybe I should add ... I really like this!</td>', 'Last time I stood on this spot, I was on a Segway. What a hoot, but I digress. This is an extraordinary image. The vignette and grain therein are wonderful. The wide angle distortion is wonderful. It''s an interesting subject. Details, focus and clarity are good. B&W is good. Maybe I should add ... I really like this!', '2009-12-05 03:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755345, 836842, 18197, '<td valign="top">Americana (I think) at its best. Normally the vignette would bother me, but in this case I think it''s positive.</td>', 'Americana (I think) at its best. Normally the vignette would bother me, but in this case I think it''s positive.', '2009-12-05 03:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755347, 835350, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oh, how cute. This is a professional quality image you should be quite proud of. Pro quality in every way.</td>', 'Oh, how cute. This is a professional quality image you should be quite proud of. Pro quality in every way.', '2009-12-05 03:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755348, 833822, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the high key nature of this.</td>', 'Love the high key nature of this.', '2009-12-05 03:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755434, 835350, 86799, '<td valign="top">If only it''s head were tipped back "just enough" to get a little bit of eye in the picture...  But a beautiful shot anyhow.</td>', 'If only it''s head were tipped back "just enough" to get a little bit of eye in the picture...  But a beautiful shot anyhow.', '2009-12-05 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755450, 835678, 86799, '<td valign="top">Evocative.  I like the title, fits well, but would have left off the ...  And maybe you could have come in closer for more detail of subject and immediate surroundings without losing the statement.</td>', 'Evocative.  I like the title, fits well, but would have left off the ...  And maybe you could have come in closer for more detail of subject and immediate surroundings without losing the statement.', '2009-12-05 08:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755460, 835955, 86799, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed.  Looks like a paper cutout boat pasted on a water scene.</td>', 'Overprocessed.  Looks like a paper cutout boat pasted on a water scene.', '2009-12-05 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755464, 835829, 86799, '<td valign="top">Fun pic, properly composed and executed.  Good work.</td>', 'Fun pic, properly composed and executed.  Good work.', '2009-12-05 08:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755472, 836848, 86799, '<td valign="top">Smooth and serene.  "just" a picture of a drive in the fall, but it beckons to me and invites me to come along to see more.  Very nice.</td>', 'Smooth and serene.  "just" a picture of a drive in the fall, but it beckons to me and invites me to come along to see more.  Very nice.', '2009-12-05 09:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755474, 836598, 86799, '<td valign="top">I stopped and photographed a bee like that once.  After about 10 shots I came to the conclusion he was just dead.  Great detail and color, cool shot.</td>', 'I stopped and photographed a bee like that once.  After about 10 shots I came to the conclusion he was just dead.  Great detail and color, cool shot.', '2009-12-05 09:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755492, 836616, 101668, '<td valign="top">Colours are great. A Nile crocodile?</td>', 'Colours are great. A Nile crocodile?', '2009-12-05 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755505, 836314, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky and red / orange tones in the cliffs. Perhaps a bit too contrasty, and the foreground could be more interesting. It''s a bit uniform and without much depth.</td>', 'Wonderful sky and red / orange tones in the cliffs. Perhaps a bit too contrasty, and the foreground could be more interesting. It''s a bit uniform and without much depth.', '2009-12-05 09:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755506, 836022, 49788, '<td valign="top">What a moment, but I find the cropping too close. Would love to see the full wings.</td>', 'What a moment, but I find the cropping too close. Would love to see the full wings.', '2009-12-05 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755508, 836922, 49788, '<td valign="top">Neat. I like the idea of a timepiece buried in sand (from an hour glass?) Nice lighting.</td>', 'Neat. I like the idea of a timepiece buried in sand (from an hour glass?) Nice lighting.', '2009-12-05 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755510, 835824, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very moody atmosphere and neat backlighting and shadows in the foreground. Neat. I would say the sky has been burned a bit too much, as it looks a bit artificial up there, and I would have liked to see the detail in some of the branches.</td>', 'Very moody atmosphere and neat backlighting and shadows in the foreground. Neat. I would say the sky has been burned a bit too much, as it looks a bit artificial up there, and I would have liked to see the detail in some of the branches.', '2009-12-05 09:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755512, 834546, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple composition with nice contrasts but also some interesting mid-tones in the left of the background.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple composition with nice contrasts but also some interesting mid-tones in the left of the background.', '2009-12-05 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755514, 835727, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice moment caught here. I really like the blown out background with the bright red in the foreground and the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Nice moment caught here. I really like the blown out background with the bright red in the foreground and the reflection in the water.', '2009-12-05 09:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755515, 836853, 49788, '<td valign="top">Neat! I love the drops on the branches. What  cool effect. This photo feels very very wet. I like it. It might have been even better if the boats were better framed by the branches; they sort of creep into them a bit, which makes them harder to appreciate.</td>', 'Neat! I love the drops on the branches. What  cool effect. This photo feels very very wet. I like it. It might have been even better if the boats were better framed by the branches; they sort of creep into them a bit, which makes them harder to appreciate.', '2009-12-05 09:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755517, 836046, 49788, '<td valign="top">Really nice portrait. Great tones and wonderful detail. Not sure it needed the softening / vaseline lens effect in places.</td>', 'Really nice portrait. Great tones and wonderful detail. Not sure it needed the softening / vaseline lens effect in places.', '2009-12-05 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755521, 835955, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the photo is over-processed and noisy.</td>', 'Nice composition but the photo is over-processed and noisy.', '2009-12-05 09:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755531, 836665, 49788, '<td valign="top">Love the moody atmosphere, but I think the photo would have benefitted from a foreground element.</td>', 'Love the moody atmosphere, but I think the photo would have benefitted from a foreground element.', '2009-12-05 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755535, 835720, 49788, '<td valign="top">Really nice crop and very natural looking tones. Love the diagonal branch and the nice blue to green gradient in the background. The touch of orange and yellow in the birds wing and tail really ad a lot, too.</td>', 'Really nice crop and very natural looking tones. Love the diagonal branch and the nice blue to green gradient in the background. The touch of orange and yellow in the birds wing and tail really ad a lot, too.', '2009-12-05 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755537, 836780, 49788, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds and light, but the centered composition makes the photo feel a bit... static. I can see how that would sort of work with the "sentinel" them you were going for, but still think the photo would improve with a different composition of the subject.</td>', 'Nice clouds and light, but the centered composition makes the photo feel a bit... static. I can see how that would sort of work with the "sentinel" them you were going for, but still think the photo would improve with a different composition of the subject.', '2009-12-05 09:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755541, 836658, 49788, '<td valign="top">Very neat framing of the airplane with the barbed wire. You used what could have been really distracting to enhance the photo. I might have cropped out more of the ground, since there''s not much interesting there, and put the plane a bit more off-center. But overall a nice photo. I really like it.</td>', 'Very neat framing of the airplane with the barbed wire. You used what could have been really distracting to enhance the photo. I might have cropped out more of the ground, since there''s not much interesting there, and put the plane a bit more off-center. But overall a nice photo. I really like it.', '2009-12-05 09:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755544, 836591, 49788, '<td valign="top">Really nice crop, good detail, and I love the blue background. It works really nicely with the yellowish in the giraffe.</td>', 'Really nice crop, good detail, and I love the blue background. It works really nicely with the yellowish in the giraffe.', '2009-12-05 09:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755560, 836184, 11394, '<td valign="top">I like this, it makes me think of the penguin from batman.</td>', 'I like this, it makes me think of the penguin from batman.', '2009-12-05 10:03:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5755561, 836593, 35086, '<td valign="top">At first I thought that was from flat, that would have been huge!  Good picture though, having that kid to the right helps in my opinion, makes me ''wonder'' if he could ollie over him. :)<br/> <br/>Good stuff.</td>', 'At first I thought that was from flat, that would have been huge!  Good picture though, having that kid to the right helps in my opinion, makes me ''wonder'' if he could ollie over him. :) Good stuff.', '2009-12-05 10:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755564, 833628, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like how centered this is.  In this instance, there is a nice balance of active and dead space with the beautiful lights right between both.  I also like how you chose to frame this.<br/> <br/>I actually wrote that before reading the title for the piece, which is something I usually do.  Very fitting indeed!</td>', 'I like how centered this is.  In this instance, there is a nice balance of active and dead space with the beautiful lights right between both.  I also like how you chose to frame this. I actually wrote that before reading the title for the piece, which is something I usually do.  Very fitting indeed!', '2009-12-05 10:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755567, 836698, 35086, '<td valign="top">I traveled all the way from the east coast to northern Alberta and then down the rockies but ran out of money so I couldn''t make it to Vancouver.  This shot makes me regret not having gone there anyways.  <br/> <br/>This is just beautiful, thanks for bringing Vancouver to me with this stunning picture. :)</td>', 'I traveled all the way from the east coast to northern Alberta and then down the rockies but ran out of money so I couldn''t make it to Vancouver.  This shot makes me regret not having gone there anyways.   This is just beautiful, thanks for bringing Vancouver to me with this stunning picture. :)', '2009-12-05 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755571, 835350, 73747, '<td valign="top">This is just....  perfect! 10</td>', 'This is just....  perfect! 10', '2009-12-05 10:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755572, 836855, 73747, '<td valign="top">Superb pet portrait! 8</td>', 'Superb pet portrait! 8', '2009-12-05 10:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755583, 833400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''m a little weirded out by the pattern on the arms matching the pattern on the floor/table/whatever below.  Makes me think of chameleon-like aliens.  But with tender hearts ;-)</td>', 'Interesting.  I''m a little weirded out by the pattern on the arms matching the pattern on the floor/table/whatever below.  Makes me think of chameleon-like aliens.  But with tender hearts ;-)', '2009-12-05 10:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755585, 835525, 65234, '<td valign="top">And bugs have been hard at work here.  Adds some nice shapes to the pattern.  Light is wonderful; sky may be a tad oversaturated.</td>', 'And bugs have been hard at work here.  Adds some nice shapes to the pattern.  Light is wonderful; sky may be a tad oversaturated.', '2009-12-05 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755588, 835977, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; awesome composition!  Definitely gets my imagination going :-)</td>', 'Wow; awesome composition!  Definitely gets my imagination going :-)', '2009-12-05 10:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5755591, 836397, 65234, '<td valign="top">Selective desat and limited palette does wonders for focussing in on the moment.  Excellent processing choices; nice DOF, too, and sweet moment to capture.</td>', 'Selective desat and limited palette does wonders for focussing in on the moment.  Excellent processing choices; nice DOF, too, and sweet moment to capture.', '2009-12-05 10:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
