(5755910, 836742, 83313, '<td valign="top">This has the soft, low res look of a photo shot many years ago. That look may not be intentional however. I see heavy compression artifacts around the roofline and in other places through the image. The 52k file size tells me this is indeed heavily compressed. That compression is what is killing all the detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can, but still come in under the challenge limit.</td>', 'This has the soft, low res look of a photo shot many years ago. That look may not be intentional however. I see heavy compression artifacts around the roofline and in other places through the image. The 52k file size tells me this is indeed heavily compressed. That compression is what is killing all the detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can, but still come in under the challenge limit.', '2009-12-05 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
