(5756891, 835719, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love strong perspective wideangle shots, but I''m generally not a fan of the fisheye look except when it suits the scene. For me, this is not really doing anything to enhance the scene. However, this is very much a personal preference thing, and not really a flaw. I have no doubt that many others will like this a lot.</td>', 'I love strong perspective wideangle shots, but I''m generally not a fan of the fisheye look except when it suits the scene. For me, this is not really doing anything to enhance the scene. However, this is very much a personal preference thing, and not really a flaw. I have no doubt that many others will like this a lot.', '2009-12-06 14:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756892, 836256, 18197, '<td valign="top">It would be fun to be hiking here on a fall day. It seems like it was a very bright day and maybe it''s a bit over exposed. And yet the shadows are pretty dark. This scene would be a good candidate for HDR.</td>', 'It would be fun to be hiking here on a fall day. It seems like it was a very bright day and maybe it''s a bit over exposed. And yet the shadows are pretty dark. This scene would be a good candidate for HDR.', '2009-12-06 14:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
