(5756900, 836826, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great color. Pleasant scene. Well composed. Good detail. Wouldn''t mind sitting there a spell, too. Well done.</td>', 'Great color. Pleasant scene. Well composed. Good detail. Wouldn''t mind sitting there a spell, too. Well done.', '2009-12-06 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756901, 834031, 83313, '<td valign="top">Composition comes off a bit awkward to me, in fact the stream was the last thing I noticed in the scene.</td>', 'Composition comes off a bit awkward to me, in fact the stream was the last thing I noticed in the scene.', '2009-12-06 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756903, 835629, 18197, '<td valign="top">Oh this is nice. Among the best Fall landscapes we''ve seen this challenge. I like the lines of the road/bridge. The shape of the stream is good. Like your capture of flowing water. Good realistic color. Plenty of detail, especially in the foliage. Well done.</td>', 'Oh this is nice. Among the best Fall landscapes we''ve seen this challenge. I like the lines of the road/bridge. The shape of the stream is good. Like your capture of flowing water. Good realistic color. Plenty of detail, especially in the foliage. Well done.', '2009-12-06 14:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756904, 835542, 83313, '<td valign="top">Her face and hair have the look of a 20''s glamour girl, but he rest of the image suggests a bit of 21st century kink.</td>', 'Her face and hair have the look of a 20''s glamour girl, but he rest of the image suggests a bit of 21st century kink.', '2009-12-06 14:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756905, 834865, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hong Kong? Nice work with cityscape. The people in the foreground give it a different feel from other takes on the same scene. Panorama-like aspect ratio works well. City lights well exposed. Good work!</td>', 'Hong Kong? Nice work with cityscape. The people in the foreground give it a different feel from other takes on the same scene. Panorama-like aspect ratio works well. City lights well exposed. Good work!', '2009-12-06 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756907, 834089, 18197, '<td valign="top">To be honest, I am growing tired of misty water shots. But you''ve done something with this one i quite like. The green in the foreground, the blueish white of the middle ground, and the reds/oranges/yellows of the background make this an interesting and pleasing scene.</td>', 'To be honest, I am growing tired of misty water shots. But you''ve done something with this one i quite like. The green in the foreground, the blueish white of the middle ground, and the reds/oranges/yellows of the background make this an interesting and pleasing scene.', '2009-12-06 15:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756908, 834616, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is coming off to me a bit dim and soft, I''m afraid. Nothing really seems to grab my attention as the subject, or is leading my eye through the frame. Perhaps some of it could be the centered waterline making for a static composition. Not totally sure, however.</td>', 'This is coming off to me a bit dim and soft, I''m afraid. Nothing really seems to grab my attention as the subject, or is leading my eye through the frame. Perhaps some of it could be the centered waterline making for a static composition. Not totally sure, however.', '2009-12-06 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756909, 835214, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Lighting, color, detail and flow are all perfectly captured and presented. Nice job on the border ... which dresses up the photo. Very nice work!</td>', 'Lovely photo. Lighting, color, detail and flow are all perfectly captured and presented. Nice job on the border ... which dresses up the photo. Very nice work!', '2009-12-06 15:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756911, 834603, 18197, '<td valign="top">Stark image. Reminds us this is a predator and it feels like its attention has just fallen on ME. Kind of spooky in a way. I like it.</td>', 'Stark image. Reminds us this is a predator and it feels like its attention has just fallen on ME. Kind of spooky in a way. I like it.', '2009-12-06 15:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756912, 831702, 83313, '<td valign="top">That is the first thing I thought of when I saw the image, that it was one of your custom camera straps in the photo. Then the title confirmed it for me.</td>', 'That is the first thing I thought of when I saw the image, that it was one of your custom camera straps in the photo. Then the title confirmed it for me.', '2009-12-06 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756913, 836732, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''d love to trade my weather for hers right now! Water feels warm, the breezes pleasant. Like the leading lines and the way the basic shapes move my eye around the photo. Cool.</td>', 'I''d love to trade my weather for hers right now! Water feels warm, the breezes pleasant. Like the leading lines and the way the basic shapes move my eye around the photo. Cool.', '2009-12-06 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756914, 835398, 83313, '<td valign="top">Must be toy horse month on DPC. I didn''t get the memo, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Must be toy horse month on DPC. I didn''t get the memo, I''m afraid.', '2009-12-06 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756916, 836587, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think your choice of sepia was interesting. It gives the photo an entirely different feeling than if you''d left it naturally colored. Looks like a pleasant place to have a cottage.</td>', 'I think your choice of sepia was interesting. It gives the photo an entirely different feeling than if you''d left it naturally colored. Looks like a pleasant place to have a cottage.', '2009-12-06 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756919, 832577, 18197, '<td valign="top">When I was a kid, I was in a sailing school and we raced to practice our newly acquired skills. You''ve just taken me back in time to those pleasant experiences. Glad you left the bird in the frame. Foreground water seems to have some sharpening/jpg artifacts. I might have tried blurring it just a little.</td>', 'When I was a kid, I was in a sailing school and we raced to practice our newly acquired skills. You''ve just taken me back in time to those pleasant experiences. Glad you left the bird in the frame. Foreground water seems to have some sharpening/jpg artifacts. I might have tried blurring it just a little.', '2009-12-06 15:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756920, 835947, 18197, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel sad. Dismal place. Busker with no audience and no visible prospect of one. You''ve conveyed the emotion of this very well.</td>', 'Makes me feel sad. Dismal place. Busker with no audience and no visible prospect of one. You''ve conveyed the emotion of this very well.', '2009-12-06 15:14:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5756921, 836852, 18197, '<td valign="top">Made me smile. Reminds me of a Jack Benny stare (you may have to google this). Oh, and the pictured is well imagined, captured, and presented.</td>', 'Made me smile. Reminds me of a Jack Benny stare (you may have to google this). Oh, and the pictured is well imagined, captured, and presented.', '2009-12-06 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756922, 835525, 18197, '<td valign="top">The DOF of field really shows off your subject. I never realized that individual leaves don''t change color all at once. Hmm ... that''s interesting.</td>', 'The DOF of field really shows off your subject. I never realized that individual leaves don''t change color all at once. Hmm ... that''s interesting.', '2009-12-06 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756926, 836801, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicee portrait of a lovely girl. You''ve allowed her personality to shine through. Nice foreground detail (especially hair and eyes) and good choice for DOF to set off your subject.</td>', 'Nicee portrait of a lovely girl. You''ve allowed her personality to shine through. Nice foreground detail (especially hair and eyes) and good choice for DOF to set off your subject.', '2009-12-06 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756928, 836592, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely model. Good detail in things that should be detailed. Maybe a little too smooth on the skin for my taste, unless of course she really has flawless skin. . Shooting into the sun was an interesting choice. I actually like it and the resulting lens flairs. Nice photo. Thanks.</td>', 'Lovely model. Good detail in things that should be detailed. Maybe a little too smooth on the skin for my taste, unless of course she really has flawless skin. . Shooting into the sun was an interesting choice. I actually like it and the resulting lens flairs. Nice photo. Thanks.', '2009-12-06 15:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756931, 836266, 18197, '<td valign="top">This could easily be a poster for a movie. It creates many unanswered questions. Who is this guy. Where is he going? Why? Why now? The swath of green in the otherwise mostly B&amp;W gives us some hope it will not end badly. Super job.</td>', 'This could easily be a poster for a movie. It creates many unanswered questions. Who is this guy. Where is he going? Why? Why now? The swath of green in the otherwise mostly B&W gives us some hope it will not end badly. Super job.', '2009-12-06 15:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756933, 833193, 18197, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to throw up and I mean that in a good way. I get motions sick on rides like this. This captures almost perfectly my childhood fascination with rides at the fair. Fear. Fantasy. Excitement.</td>', 'Makes me want to throw up and I mean that in a good way. I get motions sick on rides like this. This captures almost perfectly my childhood fascination with rides at the fair. Fear. Fantasy. Excitement.', '2009-12-06 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756935, 836838, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. You''ve taken a terrestrial scene and made it feel like it''s under water. The blue and the diagonal streaks feel like water. The red leaves have a coral feeling to them. You may (or may not) have intended this but I like the feeling of the shot and how my head goes back and forth between land and sea.</td>', 'This is interesting. You''ve taken a terrestrial scene and made it feel like it''s under water. The blue and the diagonal streaks feel like water. The red leaves have a coral feeling to them. You may (or may not) have intended this but I like the feeling of the shot and how my head goes back and forth between land and sea.', '2009-12-06 15:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756936, 836166, 18197, '<td valign="top">I rarely like distressed borders like this, but in this case it works perfectly. The photo is well composed and the lines of the two animals keep my eye circling the frame and never let me leave it.</td>', 'I rarely like distressed borders like this, but in this case it works perfectly. The photo is well composed and the lines of the two animals keep my eye circling the frame and never let me leave it.', '2009-12-06 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756937, 835580, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the fall stream scene. The focus on the leaves in the foreground reminds us why fall colors are what they are. I''m not sure how I''d approach it, but the leaves get lost a bit in the background because the colors, luminosity, and saturation are similar. I might try changing one or more of those to bring a bit more attention to the leaves.</td>', 'Interesting take on the fall stream scene. The focus on the leaves in the foreground reminds us why fall colors are what they are. I''m not sure how I''d approach it, but the leaves get lost a bit in the background because the colors, luminosity, and saturation are similar. I might try changing one or more of those to bring a bit more attention to the leaves.', '2009-12-06 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756938, 833034, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautifully detailed. Love the high contrast. Composition feels a little tight at the top.</td>', 'Beautifully detailed. Love the high contrast. Composition feels a little tight at the top.', '2009-12-06 15:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756940, 836634, 18197, '<td valign="top">Indeed she is. Neat neat photo of a pretty girl well imagined, captured and presented. In this case a border would have dressed up the photo and sold your title even further.</td>', 'Indeed she is. Neat neat photo of a pretty girl well imagined, captured and presented. In this case a border would have dressed up the photo and sold your title even further.', '2009-12-06 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756943, 833272, 18197, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon (assume it''s a hill sloping to the left) offsets the centered composition. Both, individually would be no nos, but in this case, it seems to work and gives the steer an in-your-face appeal.</td>', 'The tilted horizon (assume it''s a hill sloping to the left) offsets the centered composition. Both, individually would be no nos, but in this case, it seems to work and gives the steer an in-your-face appeal.', '2009-12-06 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756944, 836192, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sign of the times ... not so much the economy, but of the changing times. Good color, detail and lighting.</td>', 'Sign of the times ... not so much the economy, but of the changing times. Good color, detail and lighting.', '2009-12-06 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756945, 836105, 18197, '<td valign="top">My son-in-law does this. It''s fun, exciting, and muddy! Good photo of the sport.</td>', 'My son-in-law does this. It''s fun, exciting, and muddy! Good photo of the sport.', '2009-12-06 15:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756946, 832792, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great photo of this interesting bird. Detail is superb on the bird, and dof does a nice job isolating it from the background.</td>', 'Great photo of this interesting bird. Detail is superb on the bird, and dof does a nice job isolating it from the background.', '2009-12-06 15:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756948, 836742, 18197, '<td valign="top">True, just another day, but where? I like that you didn''t tell us. Feels like one of those nostalgic newspaper photos taken 75 years ago. The strength of this is the composition, the lighting, and the interesting sky/cityscape shapes. There will be some who don''t like the soft focus, but it seems to works well here.</td>', 'True, just another day, but where? I like that you didn''t tell us. Feels like one of those nostalgic newspaper photos taken 75 years ago. The strength of this is the composition, the lighting, and the interesting sky/cityscape shapes. There will be some who don''t like the soft focus, but it seems to works well here.', '2009-12-06 15:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756950, 835398, 18197, '<td valign="top">Made me grin. And your title says it perfectly ... parody. But even a parody needs a healthy kernel of some reality to parody ... and you nailed this one!</td>', 'Made me grin. And your title says it perfectly ... parody. But even a parody needs a healthy kernel of some reality to parody ... and you nailed this one!', '2009-12-06 15:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756952, 836232, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. Nice colors. Good control of gradient-like lighting. Might like to see just a bit more of the foreground. It''s prety dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Interesting scene. Nice colors. Good control of gradient-like lighting. Might like to see just a bit more of the foreground. It''s prety dark on my monitor.', '2009-12-06 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756953, 836054, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have wanted to visit Petra for some time. I like your treatment of this iconic landmark. It feels a bit like HDR where the foreground on the left went just a little too far. I like the detail you''ve preserved both in the foreground and the background.</td>', 'I have wanted to visit Petra for some time. I like your treatment of this iconic landmark. It feels a bit like HDR where the foreground on the left went just a little too far. I like the detail you''ve preserved both in the foreground and the background.', '2009-12-06 15:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756954, 836854, 18197, '<td valign="top">What a candid moment. Well composed.</td>', 'What a candid moment. Well composed.', '2009-12-06 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756956, 836780, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat cactus. Love the detail there and the soft DOF elsewhere. Details draw my attention right where you wanted it.</td>', 'Neat cactus. Love the detail there and the soft DOF elsewhere. Details draw my attention right where you wanted it.', '2009-12-06 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756994, 833789, 49788, '<td valign="top">Wow! Incredible sharpness and detail. I would love to know what sharpening / resizing method you used -- I had to check that my screen hadn''t suddenly doubled its DPI!! Wonderful tones, too.<br/> <br/>The branch on the left is a bit distracting, but still: I wish I had take this photo.</td>', 'Wow! Incredible sharpness and detail. I would love to know what sharpening / resizing method you used -- I had to check that my screen hadn''t suddenly doubled its DPI!! Wonderful tones, too. The branch on the left is a bit distracting, but still: I wish I had take this photo.', '2009-12-06 16:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756995, 833822, 107625, '<td valign="top">Awesome. what more is there to say.</td>', 'Awesome. what more is there to say.', '2009-12-06 16:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757013, 836750, 81530, '<td valign="top">This little guy seems to be making his rounds in this challenge :)</td>', 'This little guy seems to be making his rounds in this challenge :)', '2009-12-06 16:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757014, 836811, 81530, '<td valign="top">lol. The last photo had this horse as well! :)</td>', 'lol. The last photo had this horse as well! :)', '2009-12-06 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757015, 836847, 81530, '<td valign="top">omg lol This is the 4th horse I have seen. I wonder how many more I will see in voting?</td>', 'omg lol This is the 4th horse I have seen. I wonder how many more I will see in voting?', '2009-12-06 17:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757016, 833034, 81530, '<td valign="top">Looks great Andrew. Good luck!</td>', 'Looks great Andrew. Good luck!', '2009-12-06 17:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757036, 833882, 81530, '<td valign="top">Looks awesome! Hope it''s doing well for you.</td>', 'Looks awesome! Hope it''s doing well for you.', '2009-12-06 17:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757038, 833789, 81530, '<td valign="top">He looks smug..lol Good luck!</td>', 'He looks smug..lol Good luck!', '2009-12-06 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757040, 835398, 81530, '<td valign="top">Yay! Horsee #5. Probably my favorite one so far, although the Christmas lights one is pretty good too.</td>', 'Yay! Horsee #5. Probably my favorite one so far, although the Christmas lights one is pretty good too.', '2009-12-06 17:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757046, 836698, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good morning indeed!</td>', 'Good morning indeed!', '2009-12-06 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757057, 836772, 108040, '<td valign="top">Svakalega flott.</td>', 'Svakalega flott.', '2009-12-06 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757065, 834824, 45475, '<td valign="top">Heh, I wondered if folk were going to think it was overlayed. Glad to see it validated before the end of voting. Great experiment and I hope you do share the details on this one.</td>', 'Heh, I wondered if folk were going to think it was overlayed. Glad to see it validated before the end of voting. Great experiment and I hope you do share the details on this one.', '2009-12-06 17:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757066, 835232, 20330, '<td valign="top">the vinegetting or whatever you call the dark edges takes away from the image, imo. beautiful capture.</td>', 'the vinegetting or whatever you call the dark edges takes away from the image, imo. beautiful capture.', '2009-12-06 17:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757068, 835837, 20330, '<td valign="top">it looks nice, but unnatural. the drops are too many and too perfect, also the rest of the leaves have no water.</td>', 'it looks nice, but unnatural. the drops are too many and too perfect, also the rest of the leaves have no water.', '2009-12-06 17:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757070, 834054, 45475, '<td valign="top">If this is yours Alex, I think you''re getting ripped on the score. Would have thought an easy 6. The light and colours are lovely, and really shows off the raw beauty of Piha. Wonder if the stone wall and fencing are throwing the nitpickers off though? Still, undeserving of less than 6. Hope it improves for you.<br/> <br/>eta: ooops not Alex! Sorry about that. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-09 04:35:17.</i></td>', 'If this is yours Alex, I think you''re getting ripped on the score. Would have thought an easy 6. The light and colours are lovely, and really shows off the raw beauty of Piha. Wonder if the stone wall and fencing are throwing the nitpickers off though? Still, undeserving of less than 6. Hope it improves for you. eta: ooops not Alex! Sorry about that. ', '2009-12-06 17:57:10.000000', '2009-12-09 04:35:17.000000', 1),
(5757091, 836661, 20330, '<td valign="top">wth? um... nice capture, all but the huge red monkey penis</td>', 'wth? um... nice capture, all but the huge red monkey penis', '2009-12-06 18:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757099, 831846, 20330, '<td valign="top">I only give a few 10''s per challenge, and during a free study its usually hard... but this is a 10. I love the coloring, the silhouettes, the light, reflections, etc etc... beautiful image!</td>', 'I only give a few 10''s per challenge, and during a free study its usually hard... but this is a 10. I love the coloring, the silhouettes, the light, reflections, etc etc... beautiful image!', '2009-12-06 18:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757100, 834977, 20330, '<td valign="top">can''t wait to find out where this is.. its gorgeous!! love the pinks, the yellows while keeping the white exposed properly... stunning.</td>', 'can''t wait to find out where this is.. its gorgeous!! love the pinks, the yellows while keeping the white exposed properly... stunning.', '2009-12-06 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757101, 836817, 20330, '<td valign="top">A wonderful undersea capture!</td>', 'A wonderful undersea capture!', '2009-12-06 18:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757103, 836069, 20330, '<td valign="top">I love the minimalistic feel, the reflection, and the soft coloring.. beautiful shot.</td>', 'I love the minimalistic feel, the reflection, and the soft coloring.. beautiful shot.', '2009-12-06 18:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757123, 836691, 20330, '<td valign="top">lensbaby? I LOVE it!! It feels so gothic, so hitchcock, just wonderful. my only complaint would be the grain. I like a bit but the only place i can really see it is the clouds.</td>', 'lensbaby? I LOVE it!! It feels so gothic, so hitchcock, just wonderful. my only complaint would be the grain. I like a bit but the only place i can really see it is the clouds.', '2009-12-06 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757125, 832932, 20330, '<td valign="top">Very innovative and original. I love the colors, the blocking, the surreal look. It took me a minute to figure out what it was, and I love an image that makes me think! 9</td>', 'Very innovative and original. I love the colors, the blocking, the surreal look. It took me a minute to figure out what it was, and I love an image that makes me think! 9', '2009-12-06 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757127, 836808, 20330, '<td valign="top">The coloring is superb on this. I love the composition and again, the colors really make this a wonderful photo. 9</td>', 'The coloring is superb on this. I love the composition and again, the colors really make this a wonderful photo. 9', '2009-12-06 18:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757128, 834983, 50695, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I guess your competition is over? ;)</td>', 'Hmm... I guess your competition is over? ;)', '2009-12-06 18:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757130, 836755, 20330, '<td valign="top">A solid 10. I''m sure this was captured in a zoo or something, but I love it.. its like a look into the lives of the monkeys. I love the action of the photo, the stick chewing, the ''just hanging'' look, the dof. A really nice image for your portfolio! 10</td>', 'A solid 10. I''m sure this was captured in a zoo or something, but I love it.. its like a look into the lives of the monkeys. I love the action of the photo, the stick chewing, the ''just hanging'' look, the dof. A really nice image for your portfolio! 10', '2009-12-06 18:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757132, 836820, 20330, '<td valign="top">I love it, but as a fan of the series, its Lestat de Lioncourt.</td>', 'I love it, but as a fan of the series, its Lestat de Lioncourt.', '2009-12-06 18:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757133, 836912, 20330, '<td valign="top">The white border takes away from the image imo... otherwise, a great image! 8</td>', 'The white border takes away from the image imo... otherwise, a great image! 8', '2009-12-06 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757135, 836696, 20330, '<td valign="top">a superb capture! 8</td>', 'a superb capture! 8', '2009-12-06 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757137, 836034, 20330, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of Narnia. I love it =) 8</td>', 'It reminds me of Narnia. I love it =) 8', '2009-12-06 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757139, 836810, 20330, '<td valign="top">my highest rated portrait in this challenge. I love the softness and they way you have injected the models own personal style into the image.</td>', 'my highest rated portrait in this challenge. I love the softness and they way you have injected the models own personal style into the image.', '2009-12-06 18:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757140, 835747, 20330, '<td valign="top">wow! great! look forward to the ''how I did this''</td>', 'wow! great! look forward to the ''how I did this''', '2009-12-06 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757144, 834431, 20330, '<td valign="top">not so crazy about the border... love the green hue but would also love to see this in a sharp b/w. really nice capture!</td>', 'not so crazy about the border... love the green hue but would also love to see this in a sharp b/w. really nice capture!', '2009-12-06 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757186, 834983, 83313, '<td valign="top">So what happened? Did the kids finally get tired of modeling for you? As usual, a good, well lit portrait.</td>', 'So what happened? Did the kids finally get tired of modeling for you? As usual, a good, well lit portrait.', '2009-12-06 19:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757188, 836696, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww!!! This is really an "Awwww-ful" photo.</td>', 'Awwwwww!!! This is really an "Awwww-ful" photo.', '2009-12-06 19:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757190, 835569, 83313, '<td valign="top">Somehow the whole image seems a little soft and/or slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Somehow the whole image seems a little soft and/or slightly out of focus.', '2009-12-06 19:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757191, 836812, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bloomin'' shame, if ya'' ask me. But, you didn''t ask me, so I''ll keep my opinion to myself.</td>', 'A bloomin'' shame, if ya'' ask me. But, you didn''t ask me, so I''ll keep my opinion to myself.', '2009-12-06 19:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757193, 835140, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet she always sits around relaxing this way on a quiet Saturday morning.</td>', 'I''ll bet she always sits around relaxing this way on a quiet Saturday morning.', '2009-12-06 19:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757194, 836793, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and vintage feel you''ve achieved. I am noticing a color halo along the edges of the knit cap. Changing the blending mode of the layer that contains the glow/blur effect to luminosity would fix that.</td>', 'I like the softness and vintage feel you''ve achieved. I am noticing a color halo along the edges of the knit cap. Changing the blending mode of the layer that contains the glow/blur effect to luminosity would fix that.', '2009-12-06 19:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757195, 835955, 83313, '<td valign="top">Processing been taken a little far for a photographic look, but I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'Processing been taken a little far for a photographic look, but I like it nonetheless.', '2009-12-06 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757197, 834824, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. I kinda wish there was a little more happening on the left side but not a biggie.</td>', 'Nice effect. I kinda wish there was a little more happening on the left side but not a biggie.', '2009-12-06 19:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757204, 834983, 41337, '<td valign="top">I think it''s one of your better self portraits.</td>', 'I think it''s one of your better self portraits.', '2009-12-06 19:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
