(5757230, 836180, 90495, '<td valign="top">Superbly well done. Composition is very natural and honestly believable. Ribbons, in their simplicity, add what''s needed for that festive feeling I get when viewing. Job well done. I won''t mention that blown out rim because in my view it isn''t needed to enhance the image.</td>', 'Superbly well done. Composition is very natural and honestly believable. Ribbons, in their simplicity, add what''s needed for that festive feeling I get when viewing. Job well done. I won''t mention that blown out rim because in my view it isn''t needed to enhance the image.', '2009-12-06 20:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757231, 836695, 90495, '<td valign="top">Way cool.</td>', 'Way cool.', '2009-12-06 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757236, 836847, 47852, '<td valign="top">That looks like the same stuffed critter from another shot I just voted on.  Cute kitty... seems to actually tolerate the bowtie around his/her neck pretty well.</td>', 'That looks like the same stuffed critter from another shot I just voted on.  Cute kitty... seems to actually tolerate the bowtie around his/her neck pretty well.', '2009-12-06 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757238, 836751, 47852, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the woman in the back adds a nice touch to this.</td>', 'The reflection of the woman in the back adds a nice touch to this.', '2009-12-06 20:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757239, 836598, 47852, '<td valign="top">An unusual way to see butterflies, but a beautiful shot.  Probably helped that he wasn''t moving much to get that perfect focus.</td>', 'An unusual way to see butterflies, but a beautiful shot.  Probably helped that he wasn''t moving much to get that perfect focus.', '2009-12-06 20:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757240, 833284, 18197, '<td valign="top">This has a wide open prairie feeling. Interesting approach shooting right int the sun. I like where you placed the sun in the frame.</td>', 'This has a wide open prairie feeling. Interesting approach shooting right int the sun. I like where you placed the sun in the frame.', '2009-12-06 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757242, 835543, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the star artifacts around the lights. Star filter or just stopped down lens artifact?</td>', 'I like the star artifacts around the lights. Star filter or just stopped down lens artifact?', '2009-12-06 20:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757244, 836857, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the nicely saturated colors of the end of the day.</td>', 'I like the nicely saturated colors of the end of the day.', '2009-12-06 20:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757245, 835829, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot!  Love the way all the birds standing on the ground are even facing you.  Great contrast of movement and stillness, a nice curve of the beach/waves, and the little boy stands out nicely with that blue jacket.  Great job!</td>', 'What a fun shot!  Love the way all the birds standing on the ground are even facing you.  Great contrast of movement and stillness, a nice curve of the beach/waves, and the little boy stands out nicely with that blue jacket.  Great job!', '2009-12-06 20:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757247, 836689, 18197, '<td valign="top">I find photographers shooting photographers fun. Good photo, nicely composed. Sky is terrific.</td>', 'I find photographers shooting photographers fun. Good photo, nicely composed. Sky is terrific.', '2009-12-06 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757249, 836750, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hmm, theres that horse again!  He certainly does get around in a month!</td>', 'Hmm, theres that horse again!  He certainly does get around in a month!', '2009-12-06 20:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757251, 836112, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the shape of the tree. And the three bands ... sky, trees and foreground effectively divide the frame.</td>', 'Love the shape of the tree. And the three bands ... sky, trees and foreground effectively divide the frame.', '2009-12-06 20:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757253, 835975, 18197, '<td valign="top">Feels like this was shot with one light source from behind my left shoulder. I am wondering if a few more light sources would give this greater depth.</td>', 'Feels like this was shot with one light source from behind my left shoulder. I am wondering if a few more light sources would give this greater depth.', '2009-12-06 20:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757257, 834430, 18197, '<td valign="top">The day is so bright you''ve lost most of the rock detail. Contrast between lights are darks is so strong, you''ve also lost the shadows. This might be a good scene to try HDR.</td>', 'The day is so bright you''ve lost most of the rock detail. Contrast between lights are darks is so strong, you''ve also lost the shadows. This might be a good scene to try HDR.', '2009-12-06 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757258, 834728, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. The birds and especially their reflections add enough interest to keep if from becoming boring.</td>', 'Nice scene. The birds and especially their reflections add enough interest to keep if from becoming boring.', '2009-12-06 20:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757259, 833400, 18197, '<td valign="top">This feels like it was a carefully designed, set-up, and lit shot. Well captured and presented. But the flower colors don''t feel very hopeful to me. Feels more like a lost hope shot.</td>', 'This feels like it was a carefully designed, set-up, and lit shot. Well captured and presented. But the flower colors don''t feel very hopeful to me. Feels more like a lost hope shot.', '2009-12-06 20:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757261, 836733, 18197, '<td valign="top">Love the triangular shape of the red jackets and umbrellas. Wonder what was going on ... or did you really set it all up?</td>', 'Love the triangular shape of the red jackets and umbrellas. Wonder what was going on ... or did you really set it all up?', '2009-12-06 20:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757264, 836768, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this ... the fireman in front of an inferno ... a seemingly unfightable fire. I almost missed the air tank and therefore almost missed the fire fighter connection. I think I''d like it even better with more shadow detail on the fireman''s back. It feels a bit flat now, more detail would have made it come to life.</td>', 'I like this ... the fireman in front of an inferno ... a seemingly unfightable fire. I almost missed the air tank and therefore almost missed the fire fighter connection. I think I''d like it even better with more shadow detail on the fireman''s back. It feels a bit flat now, more detail would have made it come to life.', '2009-12-06 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757265, 833264, 18197, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting ... the glow of the sun, the turbulent water.</td>', 'Neat lighting ... the glow of the sun, the turbulent water.', '2009-12-06 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757268, 836837, 18197, '<td valign="top">Ballooning in the morning is great fun. This has an end-of-day feeling more than a morning feeling to me. Doesn''t diminish, just sharing a reaction.</td>', 'Ballooning in the morning is great fun. This has an end-of-day feeling more than a morning feeling to me. Doesn''t diminish, just sharing a reaction.', '2009-12-06 20:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757272, 832361, 18197, '<td valign="top">The sea as a desert ... flat, unending, apparently lifeless. You''ve sold the long night home loneliness perfectly. Maybe take advantage of the entire 800 pixels available to you?</td>', 'The sea as a desert ... flat, unending, apparently lifeless. You''ve sold the long night home loneliness perfectly. Maybe take advantage of the entire 800 pixels available to you?', '2009-12-06 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757275, 836823, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the grass and the tire. Nice color saturation.</td>', 'Nice detail in the grass and the tire. Nice color saturation.', '2009-12-06 20:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
