(5757278, 836850, 18197, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. Birds breaking the reflections are very good. Colors really sell the sunset. Border is effective. Nice work.</td>', 'Pretty scene. Birds breaking the reflections are very good. Colors really sell the sunset. Border is effective. Nice work.', '2009-12-06 20:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
