(5757306, 836913, 18197, '<td valign="top">If i owned this dog, I would treasure this photo. The dog well composed, lit, focused among the grasses is just great.</td>', 'If i owned this dog, I would treasure this photo. The dog well composed, lit, focused among the grasses is just great.', '2009-12-06 20:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
