(5757514, 831478, 99708, '<td valign="top">IMO it seems to be a bit OOF - not sure if that was the look you were going for.  <br/>I like the feel of the picture, it is one where your viewers can look at it and try to figure it out or make up their own story line to go along with it.<br/> <br/>Overall, good job.</td>', 'IMO it seems to be a bit OOF - not sure if that was the look you were going for.  I like the feel of the picture, it is one where your viewers can look at it and try to figure it out or make up their own story line to go along with it. Overall, good job.', '2009-12-06 23:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757516, 835718, 102534, '<td valign="top">cool. Need to adjust the white balance or even convert it to B&amp;W</td>', 'cool. Need to adjust the white balance or even convert it to B&W', '2009-12-06 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757545, 833480, 99708, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, in every day life it would be an eye sore, but I like how you tried to bring new life to it.</td>', 'Interesting subject, in every day life it would be an eye sore, but I like how you tried to bring new life to it.', '2009-12-07 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757549, 836812, 99708, '<td valign="top">Thank you for brining something to the table that isn''t the norm.  <br/>Overall, I like the picture, however I do feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Thank you for brining something to the table that isn''t the norm.  Overall, I like the picture, however I do feel that the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2009-12-07 00:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757553, 834603, 99708, '<td valign="top">To me he has more of a guilty caught in the act look in his eye.  Interesting shot in that it is not the normal eagle picture with their wings spread out.   I would have like to have seen it in color.</td>', 'To me he has more of a guilty caught in the act look in his eye.  Interesting shot in that it is not the normal eagle picture with their wings spread out.   I would have like to have seen it in color.', '2009-12-07 00:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757562, 835590, 99708, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you either a 6 or 7 (haven''t quite decided yet).  I would of scored higher if the person standing on the box was not cut off in the middle, or if he would of been left out of the picture all together.</td>', 'I''m giving you either a 6 or 7 (haven''t quite decided yet).  I would of scored higher if the person standing on the box was not cut off in the middle, or if he would of been left out of the picture all together.', '2009-12-07 00:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757564, 835398, 99708, '<td valign="top">Is there a pony club?  This is the 3rd time I have seen the same horse in a photo.</td>', 'Is there a pony club?  This is the 3rd time I have seen the same horse in a photo.', '2009-12-07 00:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757623, 833116, 77838, '<td valign="top">Go OSU! Oh, thats not what your photo''s saying.?  It seems a little grainy, like maybe your ISO was a bit too high OR this is cropped in pretty tight? Other than that, it''s a great action shot. BB</td>', 'Go OSU! Oh, thats not what your photo''s saying.?  It seems a little grainy, like maybe your ISO was a bit too high OR this is cropped in pretty tight? Other than that, it''s a great action shot. BB', '2009-12-07 01:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
