(5757840, 836907, 83313, '<td valign="top">Post-vote comment:<br/>I gave this a 6. I like the detail and the deep blue sky. Good eye-leading ROT composition. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale, but it didn''t do anything to make me pause on it or say "Wow". I wonder how this would look in b/w?</td>', 'Post-vote comment:I gave this a 6. I like the detail and the deep blue sky. Good eye-leading ROT composition. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale, but it didn''t do anything to make me pause on it or say "Wow". I wonder how this would look in b/w?', '2009-12-07 08:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757903, 836691, 65234, '<td valign="top">Palpable feelin of movement.</td>', 'Palpable feelin of movement.', '2009-12-07 09:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757904, 836818, 65234, '<td valign="top">My, what big eyes he has ;-)  Looks very much like the corn one gives to squirrels in the vain hope that it will keep them away from the bird feeders!  Nice detail on the little fellow.</td>', 'My, what big eyes he has ;-)  Looks very much like the corn one gives to squirrels in the vain hope that it will keep them away from the bird feeders!  Nice detail on the little fellow.', '2009-12-07 09:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757905, 836226, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and nice eye contact.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and nice eye contact.', '2009-12-07 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
