(5757978, 834691, 83313, '<td valign="top">Post-vote comment:<br/>I gave this a 7, I like the depth that the fog gives it, and the simple composition.   I don''t think it''s got a lot instant of wow-factor, however, and I suspect that is probably holding it in the 5''s. There is perhaps a bit of a greenish cast to the fog that could have been adjusted for to make it more white. That may have aided the visual impact. Strikes me as similar to one of my own photos, though I did mine as a b/w.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=786953" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786953.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786953.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786953.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Post-vote comment:I gave this a 7, I like the depth that the fog gives it, and the simple composition.   I don''t think it''s got a lot instant of wow-factor, however, and I suspect that is probably holding it in the 5''s. There is perhaps a bit of a greenish cast to the fog that could have been adjusted for to make it more white. That may have aided the visual impact. Strikes me as similar to one of my own photos, though I did mine as a b/w.', '2009-12-07 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
