(5758438, 833512, 30982, '<td valign="top">Shots like this are the reason I still hang out at this place.  They make me realize that while we do see a lot of the same things over and over again, every now and then you get something that invites a viewer to linger, to see the stories, to make connections that perhaps even the photographer didn''t see.  Or to simply just appreciate.</td>', 'Shots like this are the reason I still hang out at this place.  They make me realize that while we do see a lot of the same things over and over again, every now and then you get something that invites a viewer to linger, to see the stories, to make connections that perhaps even the photographer didn''t see.  Or to simply just appreciate.', '2009-12-07 16:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
