(5759403, 834431, 37845, '<td valign="top">This photo is incredible. Im glad it finished above 6 for you, but I still maintain it deserves much better.</td>', 'This photo is incredible. Im glad it finished above 6 for you, but I still maintain it deserves much better.', '2009-12-08 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759404, 835409, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s refreshing to see astrophotography score high here. It''s a niche, I think, and can be easily lost on the voters here. So glad that this did so well. Congrats!</td>', 'It''s refreshing to see astrophotography score high here. It''s a niche, I think, and can be easily lost on the voters here. So glad that this did so well. Congrats!', '2009-12-08 00:06:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759405, 833370, 67145, '<td valign="top">congrats congrats .. a ribbon in a free study for an ugly looking fly .. how brilliant . <br/>its a fantastic shot and so dramtatic with your selective desat .. WOW .. !! ..:)</td>', 'congrats congrats .. a ribbon in a free study for an ugly looking fly .. how brilliant . its a fantastic shot and so dramtatic with your selective desat .. WOW .. !! ..:)', '2009-12-08 00:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759406, 834603, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, this proves that banding does not injure a score here. And here I''ve been fussing over it when I have it in one of my own shots! Killer placement in a freestudy, congrats.</td>', 'Well, this proves that banding does not injure a score here. And here I''ve been fussing over it when I have it in one of my own shots! Killer placement in a freestudy, congrats.', '2009-12-08 00:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759409, 836905, 110400, '<td valign="top">I don''t think that comments are seen during voting and maybe they should.  Everyone talked about the crop of this photo, but it wasn''t really a crop at all.  It was a pano that didn''t live up to the full potential due to changes in the clouds.  Thanks for the comments to those who commented.  I do hope that in the future DPC implements some rule that forces anyone giving 4 or less to leave a comment.  At least 3 or less.  that would have given me 45 comments at minimum to understand those points of view.</td>', 'I don''t think that comments are seen during voting and maybe they should.  Everyone talked about the crop of this photo, but it wasn''t really a crop at all.  It was a pano that didn''t live up to the full potential due to changes in the clouds.  Thanks for the comments to those who commented.  I do hope that in the future DPC implements some rule that forces anyone giving 4 or less to leave a comment.  At least 3 or less.  that would have given me 45 comments at minimum to understand those points of view.', '2009-12-08 00:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759414, 832288, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beyond amazing. Bravo!</td>', 'Beyond amazing. Bravo!', '2009-12-08 00:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759415, 836069, 83313, '<td valign="top">Another killer entry Wendy! I''ve rarely seen someone pull up into ribbon hog territory so quickly.</td>', 'Another killer entry Wendy! I''ve rarely seen someone pull up into ribbon hog territory so quickly.', '2009-12-08 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759417, 836691, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, sorry it didn''t quite make it over the 6.  But well done anyway, it''s a good score!</td>', 'Deb, sorry it didn''t quite make it over the 6.  But well done anyway, it''s a good score!', '2009-12-08 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759420, 832288, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great work - nice to NZ on the front page!</td>', 'Great work - nice to NZ on the front page!', '2009-12-08 00:10:56.000000', NULL, 0),
