(5759457, 836638, 83313, '<td valign="top">Did well. Anything over a 5 1/2 is in what I consider the happy zone. Especially in a freestudy. Glad to see you back on DPC.</td>', 'Did well. Anything over a 5 1/2 is in what I consider the happy zone. Especially in a freestudy. Glad to see you back on DPC.', '2009-12-08 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
