(5759467, 831077, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice to see you entered what you liked, even though you expected it to end up in mediocre-land. It got a 7 from me, however. Damn the torpedoes and full speed ahead!</td>', 'Nice to see you entered what you liked, even though you expected it to end up in mediocre-land. It got a 7 from me, however. Damn the torpedoes and full speed ahead!', '2009-12-08 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
