(5759480, 836634, 25355, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> How cute! I like the little poodle toy. Looks like the pigeons are curious too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was a poodle handbag. She kept swinging it so I was never able to get a decent shot of it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: How cute! I like the little poodle toy. Looks like the pigeons are curious too.   It was a poodle handbag. She kept swinging it so I was never able to get a decent shot of it.', '2009-12-08 00:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759481, 836122, 34462, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I hope you were wearing a harness when you took this.</td>', 'Great photo. I hope you were wearing a harness when you took this.', '2009-12-08 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759484, 836273, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 for the capture of such a quirky subject, unfortunately, I felt the lighting let it down a bit. Looks like you may have been using onboard flash. I try to avoid that at all costs. I wonder what this would have looked like with ambient light and a long exposure?<br/> <br/>I may just have to come out to Marshall sometime for a photo outing.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 for the capture of such a quirky subject, unfortunately, I felt the lighting let it down a bit. Looks like you may have been using onboard flash. I try to avoid that at all costs. I wonder what this would have looked like with ambient light and a long exposure? I may just have to come out to Marshall sometime for a photo outing.', '2009-12-08 00:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759485, 833822, 22537, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!</td>', 'Spectacular!', '2009-12-08 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759486, 836733, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ouch. You got robbed. I gave this a 9 and bumped it up to a 10 before rollover. Something about this really grabs me.</td>', 'Ouch. You got robbed. I gave this a 9 and bumped it up to a 10 before rollover. Something about this really grabs me.', '2009-12-08 00:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759488, 833370, 52549, '<td valign="top">My goodness, what a fantastic macro! I keep looking and looking at it.... fascinating.<br/>Huge congrats on the ribbon, Scott.</td>', 'My goodness, what a fantastic macro! I keep looking and looking at it.... fascinating.Huge congrats on the ribbon, Scott.', '2009-12-08 00:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759489, 836183, 91915, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Should have scored higher in my opinion.<br/></td>', 'Beautiful shot. Should have scored higher in my opinion.', '2009-12-08 00:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759490, 836750, 25355, '<td valign="top">The vase of flowers clash with his head somewhat, so it should have been moved further back, perhaps. Interesting that the lobster''s claws and the horse legs all have a band of white around them.</td>', 'The vase of flowers clash with his head somewhat, so it should have been moved further back, perhaps. Interesting that the lobster''s claws and the horse legs all have a band of white around them.', '2009-12-08 00:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759493, 836758, 52549, '<td valign="top">So dreamlike, so excellent. Congratulations on your blue ribbon and on this wonderful image, Óskar.</td>', 'So dreamlike, so excellent. Congratulations on your blue ribbon and on this wonderful image, Óskar.', '2009-12-08 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5759496, 833284, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think this is WAY better than what it got. The only thing I can figure is that it got killed for the lens flare.</td>', 'I think this is WAY better than what it got. The only thing I can figure is that it got killed for the lens flare.', '2009-12-08 00:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
