(5759501, 835409, 48657, '<td valign="top">Thanks for sharing. Reading about astrophotography, I realize just how difficult an image like this is to create. Well done, really deserves real estate on the front page.</td>', 'Thanks for sharing. Reading about astrophotography, I realize just how difficult an image like this is to create. Well done, really deserves real estate on the front page.', '2009-12-08 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
