(5759533, 835350, 73747, '<td valign="top">I am absolutely dumbfounded that this didn''t place in at least in the top 10. My faith in the DPC voting process has fallen considerably because of this. I am just shocked! It is a superb, professional quality image! And the title captures exactly what you photographed.  It will always be a 10 and a blue ribbon in my eyes!</td>', 'I am absolutely dumbfounded that this didn''t place in at least in the top 10. My faith in the DPC voting process has fallen considerably because of this. I am just shocked! It is a superb, professional quality image! And the title captures exactly what you photographed.  It will always be a 10 and a blue ribbon in my eyes!', '2009-12-08 01:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
