(5759638, 836741, 72134, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your fine comments. Only two weeks of learning to use HDR so I am pretty satisfied. The mountain is again Hekla, easy for me, since I live only 30 miles away. The farm in the foreground is now used as a musiic hall, the cowhouse and the barn and some weekends they play jazz or classical music there. Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for all your fine comments. Only two weeks of learning to use HDR so I am pretty satisfied. The mountain is again Hekla, easy for me, since I live only 30 miles away. The farm in the foreground is now used as a musiic hall, the cowhouse and the barn and some weekends they play jazz or classical music there. Thanks again.', '2009-12-08 04:51:27.000000', NULL, 0),
