(5759672, 836905, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry for assuming this was a ''crazy crop'', I''m pretty sure that panoramic images from multiple captures are outside the rules:<br/> <br/><i>You may not combine captures of different scenes, move or change a feature between frames, or combine different captures to create a new scene</i> <br/> <br/>So because of that I had assumed this was a crop. <br/> <br/>I was one of your 2s, but I did leave a comment. I still think this is a crazy aspect ratio to submit when the maximum dimension is just 800px though.<br/> <br/>I''m not going to ask for this to be validated, but you might want to flag it to the SC for your own peace of mind.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m sorry for assuming this was a ''crazy crop'', I''m pretty sure that panoramic images from multiple captures are outside the rules: You may not combine captures of different scenes, move or change a feature between frames, or combine different captures to create a new scene  So because of that I had assumed this was a crop.  I was one of your 2s, but I did leave a comment. I still think this is a crazy aspect ratio to submit when the maximum dimension is just 800px though. I''m not going to ask for this to be validated, but you might want to flag it to the SC for your own peace of mind. ', '2009-12-08 06:35:26.000000', NULL, 0),
