(5760378, 832288, 24486, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Nuzzer:</b></div><hr/><i> Great work - nice to NZ on the front page! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I completely agree, Congratulations on the ribbon. I have been down there a few times &amp; I don''t think I have ever seen the mountain that clear.</td>', 'Originally posted by Nuzzer: Great work - nice to NZ on the front page!   I completely agree, Congratulations on the ribbon. I have been down there a few times & I don''t think I have ever seen the mountain that clear.', '2009-12-08 20:22:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760401, 836691, 103142, '<td valign="top">You achieved what very few people have achieved. You made me like a lensbaby shot! I think I''ve only found 2 others that I''ve liked (for some reason, I haven''t quite figured them out yet) I thought this one was quite fun -- it seemed kind of like an Alfred Hitchcock scene!</td>', 'You achieved what very few people have achieved. You made me like a lensbaby shot! I think I''ve only found 2 others that I''ve liked (for some reason, I haven''t quite figured them out yet) I thought this one was quite fun -- it seemed kind of like an Alfred Hitchcock scene!', '2009-12-08 20:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
