(5760458, 836545, 75034, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> Ok, you have me fascinated. Where did you find this? Was it a movie set or something? Great shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s not to far from my home and it''s just some people that enjoy doing unusual things. They have built a huge lagoon and in the back of this shot they have tepees and on other spots on their property they have a story book setting something like a gingerbread house, they have an old west setting, an old school setting, an old church setting and on and on and on.....<br/> <br/>It''s really cool there.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: Ok, you have me fascinated. Where did you find this? Was it a movie set or something? Great shot!   It''s not to far from my home and it''s just some people that enjoy doing unusual things. They have built a huge lagoon and in the back of this shot they have tepees and on other spots on their property they have a story book setting something like a gingerbread house, they have an old west setting, an old school setting, an old church setting and on and on and on..... It''s really cool there. MAX!', '2009-12-08 21:32:46.000000', NULL, 0),
