(5760742, 834114, 21714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pointandshoot:</b></div><hr/><i> I suspect you could fill a gallery with just your photos of squirrels. Wonderful. </i></td></tr></table>Thanks. At this rate, probably a few hard discs too.</td>', 'Originally posted by pointandshoot: I suspect you could fill a gallery with just your photos of squirrels. Wonderful. Thanks. At this rate, probably a few hard discs too.', '2009-12-09 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760849, 835543, 102024, '<td valign="top">Yeah, at first I thought the train signal lights went with my title, but I suppose they are rather distracting.  I really didn''t have much of a choice though, this is taken out of a broken window on the third story of an abandoned building.  I had to climb up some old metal boxes to reach the window and I snapped the picture though there.<br/> <br/>There is no star filter, it''s just shot at a small aperture opening.  Thanks for looking</td>', 'Yeah, at first I thought the train signal lights went with my title, but I suppose they are rather distracting.  I really didn''t have much of a choice though, this is taken out of a broken window on the third story of an abandoned building.  I had to climb up some old metal boxes to reach the window and I snapped the picture though there. There is no star filter, it''s just shot at a small aperture opening.  Thanks for looking', '2009-12-09 01:47:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760889, 836864, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - I would perhaps desat the jetty slightly - but ptherwise very cool.</td>', 'Very cool shot - I would perhaps desat the jetty slightly - but ptherwise very cool.', '2009-12-09 02:11:36.000000', NULL, 0),
