(5770511, 834603, 68504, '<td valign="top">Riveting and extremely pleasing at the same time; I think because of the watercolour/brush painting feel of the feathers. The banding, which I would not have noticed at first were it not for the comments, really seems cunningly arranged: Van Gogh-ish, even like plasma nudged away by the energy of the eagle.  If I had to I would classify this as art rather than wildlife photography, an elevation in my opinion.</td>', 'Riveting and extremely pleasing at the same time; I think because of the watercolour/brush painting feel of the feathers. The banding, which I would not have noticed at first were it not for the comments, really seems cunningly arranged: Van Gogh-ish, even like plasma nudged away by the energy of the eagle.  If I had to I would classify this as art rather than wildlife photography, an elevation in my opinion.', '2009-12-17 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
