(5802137, 836664, 56828, '<td valign="top">I sort of like the half face idea.  I think the high key could have worked if done properly.  There are alot of areas that are overexposed.  I think your high key effort distorted some of the blue in her eyes and made it a fake color (or it could have been just the color change you did to it.  You can also see the halo around the pupil where you selected and maybe didn''t feather the selection enough (it''s a red halo).  I like hte wya the hair and earrings look.  For a shot like this i would have brought back a lot of red in the lips and brought back the colors in her eyebrows.</td>', 'I sort of like the half face idea.  I think the high key could have worked if done properly.  There are alot of areas that are overexposed.  I think your high key effort distorted some of the blue in her eyes and made it a fake color (or it could have been just the color change you did to it.  You can also see the halo around the pupil where you selected and maybe didn''t feather the selection enough (it''s a red halo).  I like hte wya the hair and earrings look.  For a shot like this i would have brought back a lot of red in the lips and brought back the colors in her eyebrows.', '2010-01-08 07:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
