(6108453, 835409, 119885, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning shot with that "enry level" camera, thou your lense is not bad :)  I will get one for me too, iR- modified of cource. I''ve always said that if I get millions in lottery I will move to Greece - such a great place for astro shooting. Here in Finland it is so frustrating, nearly hopeless - when it is dark it is cold and when it is warm (all time record today in Finalnd 37C) there is too much light. <br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/></td>', 'Absolutely stunning shot with that "enry level" camera, thou your lense is not bad :)  I will get one for me too, iR- modified of cource. I''ve always said that if I get millions in lottery I will move to Greece - such a great place for astro shooting. Here in Finland it is so frustrating, nearly hopeless - when it is dark it is cold and when it is warm (all time record today in Finalnd 37C) there is too much light.  Good luck ', '2010-07-29 11:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
