(6214189, 836258, 43463, '<td valign="top">I have been staring at this for a good long time - it was/is the blue overlay on top and what looks like pale starry sky and the bottom that gets me thinking this is a dreamy night scene. Love the colors of the autumn leaves - wish we had that change in seasons down here but then it wouldn''t be a tropical zone if it did.</td>', 'I have been staring at this for a good long time - it was/is the blue overlay on top and what looks like pale starry sky and the bottom that gets me thinking this is a dreamy night scene. Love the colors of the autumn leaves - wish we had that change in seasons down here but then it wouldn''t be a tropical zone if it did.', '2010-11-06 23:35:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6296190, 836742, 43400, '<td valign="top">It''s been over a year and hadn''t relaized that I recieved all these positive comments for this submission. I haven''t been online since late 2009. If you happen to return to this challenge and come across my image--THANK YOU for your comments and sorry for such a delay to responding. This was taken in an area of Seoul, S. Korea called Insadong or Bukcheong(?); a wll-preserved historic village modified into prominent homes and definitely a tourist attraction.</td>', 'It''s been over a year and hadn''t relaized that I recieved all these positive comments for this submission. I haven''t been online since late 2009. If you happen to return to this challenge and come across my image--THANK YOU for your comments and sorry for such a delay to responding. This was taken in an area of Seoul, S. Korea called Insadong or Bukcheong(?); a wll-preserved historic village modified into prominent homes and definitely a tourist attraction.', '2011-01-28 01:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
